Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:59.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:10.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Money, money, money. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:20.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a date with justice, one-Eyed Bart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:23.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Too bad, Sheriff. I 'm a married man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:26.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,One-Eyed Betty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:43.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you dropped something, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Jessie? - Give it up, Bart!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've reached the end of the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:49.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to go out with a bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:01.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no! - The orphans!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:06.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hate to leave early, but our ride is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:14.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's me or the kiddies, Sheriff. Take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:19.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ride like the wind, Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:26.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold him steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:33.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:55.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glad I could catch the train!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:08.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let's catch some criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:11.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't touch me, Sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,I brought my attack dog with a built-in force field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:46.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I brought my dinosaur who eats force-field dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:08.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Evil Dr. Pork Chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:13.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's Mr. Evil Dr. Pork Chop to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:17.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:57.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Buzz, shoot your laser at my badge."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:59.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Woody, no. It'll kill you." "Just do it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:06.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,"You're going to jail, Bart." "Watch out!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:09.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:12.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Just keep playing. Just pretend I 'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, Molly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:17.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay, Mom. It's a 50-foot baby from outer space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:20.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,And she's on a rampage. Run for your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:24.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buster, get out of there. Does the red light mean it's going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:27.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Say "Happy birthday" to Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:31.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Happy birthday! - Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:33.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:37.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look how tall you're getting. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:47.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,"I came as fast as I could. Buzz, behind you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Got it, Woody."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:55.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Good work, Buzz."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:22.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, places, everyone. Come on, come on. Get in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! I can't find my other eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:27.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right, whose foot's in my face? - It's mine. Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have saved our lives. We are eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:33.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! Mind if I squeeze in next to ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:37.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. No. I mean, why would I mind squeezing next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:39.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it hot in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:40.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sarge, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:47.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Careful. Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:56.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, guys. We got one shot at this. Everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:58.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're ready, Woody. Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Buzz. Make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Target is on approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:18.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like we rehearsed it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello? Anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:41.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Molly, stay out of my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:43.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wasn't in your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:45.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then who was messing with my stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:58.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,He held me! He actually held me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:03.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who we kiddin'? The kid 's 17 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:05.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,We ain't ever gettin' played with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:10.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, hey, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:13.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need a staff meeting. Everyone! A staff meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:15.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:17.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Slink, gather everyone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:19.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are gathered, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:21.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. First of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:25.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,we all knew operation Playtime was a long shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,More like a misfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:31.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we've always said this job isn't about getting played with. It's about...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:33.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Being there for Andy. We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:35.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we can try again! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:39.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'm callin' it, guys. We're closing up shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:44.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy's going to college any day now. That was our last shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going into attic mode, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep your accessories with you at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:52.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spare parts, batteries, anything you need for an orderly transition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:55.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Orderly? Don't you get it? We're done! Finished! Over the hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:58.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, now. Come on, guys. We all knew this day was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but now it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:03.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, every toy goes through this. No one wants to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:04.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sarge! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:08.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,War's over, folks. Me and the boys are moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Moving on? - You're going AWOL?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:13.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,We done our duty. Andy's grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,And let's face it, when the trash bags come out,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.59,0:09:17.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,we army guys are the first to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:19.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Trash bags? - Who said anything about trash bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:24.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,It has been an honor serving with you. Good luck, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:27.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:29.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:31.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're getting thrown away? - No. No one's getting thrown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:32.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're being abandoned! - We'll be fine, Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:37.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So why did Sarge leave? - Should we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:40.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I thought we were goin' to the attic. - I hate all this uncertainty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Hold on now. Wait a minute. Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:46.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one's getting thrown out, okay? We're all still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:50.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, we've lost friends along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:53.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wheezy and Etch and... - Bo Peep?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:58.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Even Bo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:01.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,All good toys who've gone on to new owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:05.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,But through every yard sale, every spring cleaning, Andy held on to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,He must care about us, or we wouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:13.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wait. Andy's gonna tuck us in the attic. It'll be safe and warm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:16.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And we'll all be together. - Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's games up there, and books, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:21.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The racecar track! - The racecar track. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:24.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And the old TV. - There you go, the old TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:28.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,And those guys from the Christmas decorations box. They're fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:30.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:34.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,And someday, if we're lucky, Andy may have kids of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:36.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,And he'll play with us then, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll always be there for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. Let's get our parts together, get ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:44.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,and go out on a high note.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:46.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'd better find my other eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:48.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where'd you leave it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:51.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someplace dark. And dusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:54.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's see how much we're going for on eBay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:58.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Andy's gonna take care of us. I guarantee it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:25.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You guarantee it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:28.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Buzz. What else could I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:33.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever happens, at least we'll all be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,For infinity and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:38.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I have your stereo? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why not? - 'Cause I 'm taking it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I have your computer? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:50.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Your video games? - Forget it, Molly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:52.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Andy, let's get to work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:56.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything you're not taking to college either goes in the attic, or it's trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:59.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mom, I 'm not leaving till Friday. - Come on. It's garbage day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mom. - Look, it's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:05.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Skateboard, college. Little League trophy, probably attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:08.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Apple core, trash. You can do the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you still have these toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Molly, out of my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three more days and it's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:17.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Molly, you're not off the hook either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:18.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have more toys than you know what to do with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:21.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Some of them could make other kids really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:22.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,What kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:25.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,The children at the daycare. They're always asking for donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:26.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:27.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mom. - No buts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:31.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You choose the toys you want to donate, I 'll drop them off at Sunnyside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Poor Barbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:45.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I get the Corvette.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:48.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy, come on. You need to start making decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like what are you gonna do with these toys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:52.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Should we donate them to Sunnyside?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. - Maybe sell them online?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.69,0:12:56.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom, no one's gonna want those old toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:12:58.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:00.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine. You have till Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything that's not packed for college or in the attic
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:07.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- is getting thrown out. - Whatever you say, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's happening? - We're getting thrown out, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:01.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:18.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You need a hand? - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:19.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:21.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, you gonna miss me when I 'm gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:24.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- If I say no, do I still get your room? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:25.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then, yes, I 'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:27.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:30.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This can't be happening! - Quiet! What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:42.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:47.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's not trash. That's not trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:49.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think, think, Woody. Think, think, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:53.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buster! Come here, boy! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:00.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, boy. To the curb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Buster! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:11.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get up. Buster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're on the curb! - I knew it would come to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:30.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pull, everyone! Pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:43.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It won't rip! - Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:46.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's triple- ply, high- density polyethylene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:47.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be a way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:49.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy doesn't want us. What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:50.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Point. Point. Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Push! Push!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:57.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can hear the garbage truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:00.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:39.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! Jessie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:50.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Andy threw us out. - Like we were garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:53.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Junk. He called us junk. - How could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:56.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:59.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,I should have seen this coming. It's Emily all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:02.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sarge was right. - Yeah, and Woody was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:04.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. Wait, hold on. This is no time to be hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect time to be hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:08.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Should we be hysterical? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:10.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes! - Maybe! But not right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:14.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fellas, I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:22.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.62,0:17:27.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We should 've done this years ago. - Jessie, wait. What about Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:30.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's fine, Buzz. Andy's taking him to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:31.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now we need to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:34.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.97,0:17:37.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz? - Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.30,0:17:40.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Don't you know this box is being donated?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:42.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's under control, Woody. We have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:43.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going to daycare!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:46.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Daycare? What, have you all lost your marbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:49.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, didn't you see? Andy threw us away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no. He was putting you in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Attic? So how did we end up on the curb?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:56.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,That was a mistake. Andy's mom thought you were trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. After he put us in a trash bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:00.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,And called us junk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. It looks bad. But, guys, you gotta believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure thing, college boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:09.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy's moving on, Woody. It's time we did the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:13.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Out of the box. Everyone, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:16.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Buzz. Give me a hand. We gotta get this thing outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:19.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, wait. We need to figure out what's best for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:27.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great. Great! It's gonna take us forever to get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.61,0:18:39.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Barbie. You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:44.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, Molly and I have been growing apart for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:48.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just... I can't believe she would throw me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:51.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Welcome to the club, toots. - Okay, everyone, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:54.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can get back to Andy's, but we gotta move fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll hide under the seats till we get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:57.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get it through your vinyl noggin, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:58.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy doesn't want us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:01.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was putting you in the attic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:03.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,He left us on the curb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:06.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right, calm down! Both of you! - Okay, fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:08.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just wait till you see what daycare's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:11.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why? What's it like? - Daycare is a sad, lonely place
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:15.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,for washed- up old toys who have no owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:19.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Quite the charmer, aren't ya? - You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:23.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,As soon as we get to daycare, you'll be begging to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:26.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can anyone see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There's a playground! - Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:44.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,We hit the jackpot, Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,So much for sad and lonely, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:48.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Calm down, guys. Let's just keep this in perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:50.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perspective? This place is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:54.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, it's nice! See? The door has a rainbow on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey there! - Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:01.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen you in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:04.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to drop these old toys off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:08.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is this Bonnie? - Look how big you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:10.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Say hi, sweetie. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, how are your kids? Molly and Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:16.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not kids anymore. Andy's going to college on Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:21.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You sure they won't miss these? - No, they never get played with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You see any kids? - Where is she taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:34.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look! - Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:36.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:43.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:45.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone. Recess. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:58.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- So now what do we do? - We go back to Andy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:01.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Anyone see an exit? - Exit, shmexit. Let's get played with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Careful. These toys might be jealous of new arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I want to see! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:06.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Rex! - It's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:13.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,New toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:21.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, howdy! Glad to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Boy, oh, boy, oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you. May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:36.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,The claw!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:47.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, hello there. I thought I heard new voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:52.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Sunnyside, folks. I 'm Lots-o'-Huggin' Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:54.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,But please call me Lotso.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:56.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear. We come in...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:01.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,First thing you gotta know about me, I 'm a hugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:04.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at you all. You've been through a lot today, haven't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:06.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:09.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you're safe now. We're all castoffs here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:13.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,We been dumped, donated, yard-saled, secondhanded
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,and just plain thrown out. But just you wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:20.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,you'll find being donated was the best thing that ever happened to ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:24.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Lotso, do toys here get played with every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:27.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,All day long. Five days a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:29.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,But what happens when the kids grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:31.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, now, I 'll tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:34.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,When the kids get old, new ones come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.93,0:22:37.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,When they get old, new ones replace them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:42.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll never be outgrown or neglected, never abandoned or forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:45.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,No owners means no heartbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.53,0:22:50.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's a miracle. - And you wanted us to stay at Andy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.03,0:22:52.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because we're Andy's toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:55.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,So you got donated by this Andy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:58.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it's his loss, Sheriff. He can't hurt you no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:00.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Whoa, whoa, no, no, no... - Now, let's get you all settled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:05.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ken? Where is that boy? Ken? New toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:07.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Far out! Down in a jiff, Lotso.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:14.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, who's ready for Ken's dream tour?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:17.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's show our new friends where they'll be staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.64,0:23:19.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Folks, if you want to step right this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.49,0:23:30.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi, I 'm Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:33.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barbie. Have we ever met?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:36.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I would 've remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:39.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Love your legwarmers. - Nice ascot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.66,0:23:42.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ken. Recess don't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:45.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right on, Lotso. This way, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:50.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a lot to look forward to, folks. The little ones love new toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.22,0:23:53.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What a nice bear. - And he smells like strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.22,0:23:57.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Folks, if I can share, here at Sunnyside, we've got,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:23:59.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,well, just about anything a toy could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.02,0:24:01.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spare parts, superglue,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.89,0:24:05.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,and enough fresh batteries to choke a Hungry Hungry Hippo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:07.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Think you're gettin' old? - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.73,0:24:09.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, stop your worryin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:13.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our repair spa will keep you stuffed, puffed, and lightly buffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.87,0:24:17.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,And this, well, this is where I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.41,0:24:20.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Ken's Dream House. It has a disco, it's got a dune buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.75,0:24:23.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,And a whole room just for trying on clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.21,0:24:26.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.59,0:24:29.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything except someone to share it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.76,0:24:35.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You need anything at all, you just come talk to me. Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.39,0:24:40.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you, Big Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.27,0:24:44.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come meet our new friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.48,0:24:47.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Poor baby. We were thrown out together, me and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.02,0:24:50.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Abandoned by the same owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.73,0:24:53.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we don't need owners at Sunnyside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.24,0:24:56.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,We own ourselves. We're masters of our own fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.62,0:24:58.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,We control our own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:00.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch out for puddles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.70,0:25:04.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,And here's where you folks'll be stayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:06.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Caterpillar Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:09.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look at this place. - Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:11.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Holy moly guacamole.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.88,0:25:13.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jackpot, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:15.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Whoa, puppy! - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:16.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.93,0:25:20.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.31,0:25:25.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the... Hey, little guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.64,0:25:28.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long 's it been since you all got played with?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:29.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.61,0:25:33.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, just you wait. In a few minutes, that bell's gonna ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:36.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you'll get the playtime that you've been dreamin' of.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.45,0:25:39.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Play! Real play! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.37,0:25:42.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse us, we best be headin' back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.33,0:25:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Sunnyside, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.46,0:25:45.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Take care, pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.58,0:25:47.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye, Mr. Lotso. Thank you. - Thank you, buddy boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.21,0:25:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Will I see you again? - I 'll see you tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.46,0:25:51.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- in my dreams. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.63,0:25:54.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ken, let's get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:56.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barbie, come with me. Live in my dream house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.97,0:25:58.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know it's crazy. I know we just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.93,0:26:00.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heck, you don't know me from G.I. Joe,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:02.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,but when I look at you, I feel like we were...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.97,0:26:05.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Made for each other... - ...made for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.81,0:26:07.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yay! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.06,0:26:09.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ken? - Coming, Lotso.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.23,0:26:13.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:21.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sounds like kids to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.91,0:26:25.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to get played with. Why can't time go faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.45,0:26:26.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,How many you reckon are out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:28.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,They sound so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.76,0:26:38.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, everyone, it's nice here, I admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:41.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we need to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.18,0:26:43.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can have a whole new life here, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.89,0:26:46.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,A chance to make kids happy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.52,0:26:49.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why don't you stay? - Yeah, Woody. Stay with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.35,0:26:50.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on, Woodster! - You'll get played with.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:51.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't. No. - Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.86,0:26:53.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You can make a new kid happy. - No, no. Guys, really. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.86,0:26:58.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have a kid. You have a kid. Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.86,0:27:02.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if he wants us at college, or in the attic,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.37,0:27:04.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,well, then, our job is to be there for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:06.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I 'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:09.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone who wants to join me is welcome. Come on, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:15.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.17,0:27:20.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our mission with Andy is complete, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.64,0:27:22.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.80,0:27:24.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what's important now is we stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.93,0:27:28.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't even be together if it weren't for Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.18,0:27:30.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look under your boot, Buzz. You, too, Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.73,0:27:31.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whose name is written there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.23,0:27:36.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe Andy doesn't care about us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.57,0:27:39.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course he does. He cares about all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.15,0:27:40.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was putting you in the attic. I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.90,0:27:42.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't just turn your back on him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.91,0:27:47.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, wake up! It's over! Andy is all grown up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.96,0:27:51.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.79,0:27:55.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how selfish you all are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.59,0:28:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,So this is it? After all we've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.49,0:28:25.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bullseye, no. You need to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.12,0:28:30.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bullseye, no, I said, "Stay!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:34.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.25,0:28:38.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want you left alone in the attic, okay? Now, stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:45.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.89,0:28:48.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.35,0:28:53.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bonnie, you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.87,0:29:16.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on. Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:57.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,What... What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.46,0:30:01.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, that's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.13,0:30:05.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bonnie! - Bluebells, cockleshells...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.51,0:30:08.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you are. Come on, honey. It's time to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.91,0:30:34.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.29,0:31:18.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reach for the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:22.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bluebells, cockleshells. Eenie, miny...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.84,0:31:31.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're my favorite deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.30,0:31:33.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bonnie! - Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.64,0:31:38.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.99,0:31:52.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be okay, Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.99,0:31:55.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody's going to college with Andy. It's what he's always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.83,0:31:58.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's crazy. College is no place for a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.50,0:32:00.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Toys are for playtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:03.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Speaking of playtime, they're lining up out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:05.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How many? - There must be dozens.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.34,0:32:06.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can hardly wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.67,0:32:08.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Places, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.85,0:32:24.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,At last! I 'm gonna get played with!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.81,0:32:27.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Rex? - Come to papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.41,0:33:24.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,there's a snake in my boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.12,0:33:29.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to join your posse, boys, but first I'm gonna sing a little song.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.54,0:33:30.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,A sheriff!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.51,0:33:34.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Move over, Mr. Pricklepants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.17,0:33:36.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have a guest. You want some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.05,0:33:42.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's good for you. But don't drink too much, or you'll have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.48,0:33:45.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.27,0:33:48.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hello? Hi. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.11,0:33:50.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me where I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.86,0:33:52.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,The guy's just asking a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:55.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me. I 'm trying to stay in character.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.99,0:34:00.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,My name's Buttercup. You've met Baron von Shush.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.12,0:34:01.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, I 'm Trixie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.95,0:34:04.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, hey. Guys, look, I don't know where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.29,0:34:08.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're either in a cafe in Paris or a coffee shop in New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.58,0:34:10.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'm pretty sure I just came back from the doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.42,0:34:12.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,with life-changing news.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.38,0:34:15.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,We do a lot of improv here. Just stay loose, have fun, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.67,0:34:18.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, no, no, no. I... - Who wants lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.14,0:34:24.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,It has a secret ingredient. Jelly beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:27.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody's poisoned the water hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.80,0:34:31.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Poison? Who would do such a mean thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.28,0:34:40.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,The scary witch! Look out! She's using her witch-y powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.24,0:34:42.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,"I know where to hide."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.33,0:34:48.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,She'll never find us in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.37,0:34:50.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.09,0:34:55.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,She found us! We need a spaceship to get away from the witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.71,0:34:58.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're doing great! - Are you classically-trained?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:00.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I just need to know how to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.34,0:35:01.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.97,0:35:04.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just kidding. Door's right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.39,0:35:07.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, cowboy, you just jumped right in, didn't ya? I 'm Dolly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:08.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody. - Woody?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.06,0:35:10.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really? You're gonna stick with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.69,0:35:13.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,'Cause now's your chance to change it, new room and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.44,0:35:15.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's coming from a doll named Dolly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.19,0:35:18.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who's the new guy? - Are you a real cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.95,0:35:20.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, actually... - 'Course he's not, pea brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.03,0:35:24.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He don't even have a hat. - I do too have... My hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.37,0:35:26.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Told ya. - I found a spaceship!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.83,0:35:27.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.04,0:35:30.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick, get in. Fasten your seat belts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.58,0:35:34.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Close your tray tables. Hold on. It might get a little bumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.79,0:35:37.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one, blastoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.09,0:35:45.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,You saved us, cowboy. You're our hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.73,0:35:56.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got a kink in my slink.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.82,0:36:01.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,My tail! Where's my tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:09.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.62,0:36:12.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's my nose? - Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:13.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Here's your arm. - Give me that. That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.46,0:36:14.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Honey, the mustache?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:17.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't recall playtime being quite that strenuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.59,0:36:20.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy never played with us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.92,0:36:22.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're just gonna have to make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.93,0:36:24.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,But these toddlers, they don't know how to play with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.76,0:36:27.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They're too young! - Yeah, they're sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.18,0:36:28.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, we should be in the Butterfly Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:30.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,- With the big kids! - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.52,0:36:32.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, you said it. - We'll get this straightened out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.60,0:36:35.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'll go talk to Lotso about moving us to the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.28,0:36:40.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Blast. Try that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.74,0:36:42.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's locked!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.28,0:36:45.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Same here. - Try the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.45,0:36:48.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Negatory. It's a Fenster-Schneckler 380.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.12,0:36:49.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Finest childproof lock in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.91,0:36:51.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're trapped! - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.04,0:36:53.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did anyone notice the transom?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.79,0:36:56.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, great. How do we get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.84,0:37:02.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. On three! One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.05,0:37:04.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Three! - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.47,0:37:07.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.52,0:37:20.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.49,0:37:27.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He did it! - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.24,0:37:29.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:35.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you think they had a fun playtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.21,0:37:36.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,They might hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.42,0:37:40.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, now you start. - I...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.00,0:37:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Love... - You.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.34,0:37:44.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,See? That time, I said "love." Okay, now me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:45.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, okay, okay. - I...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:47.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Love... - You.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.34,0:37:49.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,You see what I mean? It changes every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.18,0:37:50.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.97,0:37:52.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Romeo. We're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.14,0:37:54.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I 'll wait up for you. - Kisses!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.71,0:39:00.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, place your bets. Come on, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.42,0:39:01.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on. Any splits? - Heya. Bring it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.67,0:39:02.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right. - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.75,0:39:04.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on, horsey, come on! - Come on, turkey, come on, turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:06.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Gobble, gobble, baby. - Come on, horsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.55,0:39:07.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.59,0:39:09.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All right, that's it. No more bets. - Come on! Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.59,0:39:11.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me have the duck, let me have the duck, let me have the duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.76,0:39:13.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here is a duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.43,0:39:15.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I won! - Ah, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.27,0:39:18.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, Stretch takes the round. - You lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.89,0:39:20.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, minimum bet, five Monopoly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.77,0:39:22.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Coyote's wild. - Here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.19,0:39:23.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Two greens here. - Changing two double A's.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.77,0:39:25.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you guys think of the new recruits? Any keepers?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.98,0:39:27.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, please! Landfill!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.86,0:39:30.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cowgirl? Dinosaur? - Toddler fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:33.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,But that space guy, he could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.37,0:39:37.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,He ain't the sharpest knife in the place where they keep the knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.33,0:39:39.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Neither are you, Chunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.71,0:39:42.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a little keeper yourself, didn't you, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.17,0:39:44.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, lay off, Twitch. Barbie's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.75,0:39:46.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aw, Mr. Softy over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.75,0:39:48.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you expect from a girl's toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.88,0:39:53.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'm not a girl's toy! I 'm not! Why do you guys keep saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.18,0:39:54.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,All them toys are disposable.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.14,0:39:57.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll be lucky if they last us a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.10,0:40:05.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, well. Looky who we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.94,0:40:08.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.36,0:40:09.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take him to the libary.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:10.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.85,0:40:43.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,1225 Sycamore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:45.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.86,0:40:47.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,I gotta get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.36,0:40:50.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're leaving? - But didn't you have fun today?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.03,0:40:52.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, of course I did, more than I 've had in years,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.86,0:40:55.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,but, you see, I belong to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.24,0:40:58.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who's "Yid-nuh"? - I believe it's pronounced "Yid-nay".
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.37,0:41:00.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, it says "Andy."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:01.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's my Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.70,0:41:03.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,And he's leaving soon. I gotta get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.87,0:41:06.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where's home? - Elm Street. 234 Elm.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.21,0:41:09.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You guys have a map? - We're on it, cowboy. Trixie?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.76,0:41:12.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'll fire up the computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.72,0:41:21.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unhand me, you cowards! I demand to talk to Lotso!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.10,0:41:22.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zip it, Buck Rogers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.77,0:41:25.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't talk to Lotso till we say you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.11,0:41:31.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ken? What's goin' on here? Why is this toy tied up?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.73,0:41:33.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,He got out, Lotso.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.74,0:41:39.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Got out"? No, no, no, no, no. This isn't how we treat our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.78,0:41:44.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,F-oh, my Schwarz. There you go. I 'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.66,0:41:46.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lotso, there's been a mistake. - A mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.96,0:41:49.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,The children in the Caterpillar Room are not age-appropriate
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.25,0:41:50.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,for me and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.59,0:41:53.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,We respectfully request a transfer to the Butterfly Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.63,0:41:55.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, request granted!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.59,0:41:57.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But, Lotso... - Hush now, Kenneth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.05,0:42:01.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,This toy's shown initiative, leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.43,0:42:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why, I 'd say we've found ourselves a keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.06,0:42:06.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hear that, everyone? We got a keeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:12.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're calling you up to the big leagues, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.61,0:42:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,From now on, you'll have anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.53,0:42:17.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excellent. I 'll go get my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.66,0:42:20.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa. Hold on there, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.32,0:42:22.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Those Caterpillar kids need someone to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.79,0:42:24.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,But my friends don't belong there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.79,0:42:26.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,None of us do, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.96,0:42:30.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which is why, for the good of our community,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.46,0:42:32.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,we ask the newer toys, the stronger ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.00,0:42:36.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,to take on the hardships the rest of us can't bear anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.72,0:42:40.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.64,0:42:45.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I can't accept. We're a family. We stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.14,0:42:47.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Family man, huh? I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.69,0:42:50.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Put him back in the timeout chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.23,0:42:53.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are ya... Unhand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.23,0:42:56.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring in the Bookworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.91,0:43:02.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.83,0:43:05.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was filed under "Lightyear."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.50,0:43:11.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.38,0:43:15.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Accessories. Maintenance." Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.76,0:43:18.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Remove screws to access battery compartment."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.01,0:43:20.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.84,0:43:21.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.01,0:43:23.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.51,0:43:28.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,"To return your Buzz Lightyear action figure to its original factory settings..."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.98,0:43:29.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.62,0:43:32.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,"...slide the switch from Play to Demo".
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.02,0:43:36.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.94,0:43:40.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was that? - Sounds like it came from the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.36,0:43:41.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'll see what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.87,0:43:46.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you see? Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.37,0:43:49.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, just a dark hallway and... Wait. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.33,0:43:51.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:53.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.58,0:43:56.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, I really see him. In his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.96,0:44:00.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,My other eye! The one I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:06.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,this is so weird. He's packing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.31,0:44:11.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here comes Buster. Out of the way! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.85,0:44:14.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Andy's out in the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.48,0:44:17.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's looking in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.90,0:44:21.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's Mom. Why is he so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.32,0:44:25.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Oh, this is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.58,0:44:29.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's looking for us. Andy's looking for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.75,0:44:31.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's looking for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.33,0:44:34.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,So Andy does want us. I knew it! I just knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.25,0:44:36.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think he did mean to put us in the attic.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.88,0:44:38.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then, Woody was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.75,0:44:40.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Holy cow! - And you didn't believe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.76,0:44:42.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you didn't believe him first!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.38,0:44:45.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys, we gotta... We gotta go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.76,0:44:48.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lotso! - Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.64,0:44:51.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,How y'all doin' this fine evenin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.10,0:44:54.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! Have you seen Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.10,0:44:56.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's been a mistake. We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.56,0:45:01.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go? Why, you just got here. In the nick of time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.15,0:45:04.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were runnin' low on volunteers for the little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.20,0:45:06.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,They just love new toys, now, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.12,0:45:09.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Love"? We've been chewed, kicked, drooled on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.08,0:45:12.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just look at my pocketbook!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.29,0:45:17.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, here's the thing, sweet potato. You ain't leavin' Sunnyside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.79,0:45:20.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Sweet potato"! Who do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.21,0:45:25.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have over 30 accessories, and I deserve more respect...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.76,0:45:28.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.47,0:45:31.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, no one takes my wife's mouth, except me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.14,0:45:33.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give it back, you furry air freshener!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.27,0:45:34.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys. We're goin' home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.02,0:45:36.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa there, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.48,0:45:38.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not goin' anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.40,0:45:41.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? And who's gonna stop us?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.32,0:45:44.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! You're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.15,0:45:46.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.24,0:45:48.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.33,0:45:50.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.99,0:45:52.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you, nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.37,0:45:53.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.12,0:45:59.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prisoners disabled, Commander Lotso!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.54,0:46:01.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz, what are you doing? - Silence, minions of Zurg!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.84,0:46:03.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're in the custody of the Galactic Alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.01,0:46:05.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- "Zurg"? - "Galactic Alliance"?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.55,0:46:06.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.68,0:46:09.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good work, Lightyear. Now, lock 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.51,0:46:10.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:22.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.11,0:46:25.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! We're your friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.86,0:46:27.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spare me your lies, temptress.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.91,0:46:29.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your emperor's defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.45,0:46:32.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I 'm immune to your bewitching good looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.66,0:46:35.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mongo! Keep your paws off my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.37,0:46:37.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Let go of me, you drooling doofus!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.21,0:46:38.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.25,0:46:41.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think this potato needs to learn himself some manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.88,0:46:43.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take him to the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.71,0:46:46.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Put me down, you moron! Where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.55,0:46:47.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bad baby! Bad baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.05,0:46:49.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ken? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.93,0:46:52.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barbie! I told you to wait in the Dream House.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.06,0:46:54.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing to my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.72,0:46:56.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.73,0:46:59.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Barbie, wait! - Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.69,0:47:02.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're through! - Barbie! I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.90,0:47:05.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,And give me my scarf back!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.86,0:47:10.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lightyear! Explain our overnight accommodations.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:13.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir! Prisoners sleep in their cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.08,0:47:17.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any prisoner caught outside their cell spends the night in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.25,0:47:20.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roll call at dusk and dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.46,0:47:24.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any prisoner misses roll call, spends the night in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.59,0:47:27.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prisoners do not speak unless spoken to.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.42,0:47:29.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any prisoner talks back, spends the night...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.80,0:47:31.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,In the box! We get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.64,0:47:35.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,At ease, soldier. They're neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.56,0:47:39.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,But remember, they'll say anything to make you doubt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.10,0:47:40.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.52,0:47:43.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Any doubt I had got pounded out of me at the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.40,0:47:45.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen up, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.98,0:47:48.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,We got a way of doin' things here at Sunnyside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.99,0:47:51.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you start at the bottom, pay your dues,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.74,0:47:54.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,life here can be a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:57.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,But if you break our rules, step outta line,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.70,0:48:04.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,try to check out early, well, you're just hurtin' yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.71,0:48:07.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! What did you do to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.46,0:48:10.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,You all get a good night's rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.47,0:48:14.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got a full day of playtime tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.18,0:48:23.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,1225 Syca...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.81,0:48:27.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's Velocistar237?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.48,0:48:29.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's just a dinosaur toy down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.82,0:48:32.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's nothing. Let me just take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:34.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just a dinosaur. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.57,0:48:37.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sycamore. Okay, enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.16,0:48:40.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please don't be far. Please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.75,0:48:45.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right around the corner? It's right around the corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.13,0:48:50.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'm going to college! Look at me! I 'm big toy on campus! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.55,0:48:53.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, I 'll see you at the sock hop. - Okay, Potsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.51,0:48:56.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen. If any of you guys ever get to Sunnyside Daycare,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.01,0:48:58.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,you tell 'em Woody made it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.18,0:49:01.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You came from Sunnyside? - But how'd you escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.48,0:49:03.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.31,0:49:05.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "escape"?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.15,0:49:10.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sunnyside is a place of ruin and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.32,0:49:13.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ruled by an evil bear who smells of strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.03,0:49:16.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lotso?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.28,0:49:18.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,The guy may seem plush and huggable on the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.03,0:49:20.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,but inside, he's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.04,0:49:23.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,But... How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.87,0:49:26.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Chuckles. He'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.21,0:49:33.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I knew Lotso.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:38.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,He was a good toy. A friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.93,0:49:42.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Me and him, we had the same kid, Daisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.14,0:49:47.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,A was there when Lotso got unwrapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:51.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Daisy loved us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.73,0:49:52.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,But Lotso,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.36,0:49:55.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lotso was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.61,0:49:58.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,they did everything together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.82,0:50:02.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've never seen a kid and a toy more in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.79,0:50:05.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,One day, we took a drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.87,0:50:10.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hit a rest stop. Had a little playtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:13.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,After lunch, Daisy fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.35,0:50:23.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,She never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.36,0:50:31.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lotso wouldn't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:38.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,It took forever, but we finally made it back to Daisy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.20,0:50:47.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,But by then, it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.51,0:51:02.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something changed that day inside Lotso.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.01,0:51:04.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.68,0:51:07.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,She replaced us. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.23,0:51:10.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No, she only replaced you! - She replaced all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.81,0:51:11.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.98,0:51:17.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,She don't love you no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.70,0:51:19.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.99,0:51:29.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were lost. Cast off. Unloved. Unwanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.59,0:51:36.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,then we found Sunnyside.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.39,0:51:49.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,But Lotso wasn't my friend anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.44,0:51:53.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,He wasn't anyone's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.19,0:51:59.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,He took over Sunnyside and rigged the whole system.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.90,0:52:01.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,So how'd you get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:05.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got broke. Bonnie found me, took me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:08.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Other toys, they weren't so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.20,0:52:12.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,It ain't right what Lotso done. New toys,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.38,0:52:15.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,they don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.59,0:52:17.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But my friends are in there. - You can't go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.96,0:52:20.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Returning now would be suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.42,0:52:22.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,But what about your Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.30,0:52:25.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't he leaving for college?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.86,0:52:46.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quiet, musical hog! Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.24,0:52:52.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Bullseye. I miss Woody, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.50,0:52:56.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,But he ain't ever comin' back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.22,0:53:03.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.52,0:53:20.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine, campers!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.07,0:53:22.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Commander Lotso, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.57,0:53:25.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,All quiet, nothing to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.11,0:53:28.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excellent, Lightyear. Come on. We need ya back at Star Command.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.74,0:53:31.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! What've you done with my husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.70,0:53:32.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Big Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.46,0:53:39.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.13,0:53:45.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was cold and dark. Nothing but sand and a couple of Lincoln Logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.01,0:53:47.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think those were Lincoln Logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.72,0:53:51.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,You all get ready. You got a play-date with destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.85,0:55:14.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.93,0:55:16.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have come back, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.73,0:55:21.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,they've cracked down hard since you left. More guards, more patrols.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.19,0:55:23.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and your friends ain't ever getting out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.40,0:55:24.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I made it out once.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.73,0:55:27.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got lucky once. Want my advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.69,0:55:30.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep your heads down. You'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.20,0:55:31.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.91,0:55:33.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been here years.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.58,0:55:35.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,they'll never break me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.62,0:55:38.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,there's only one way toys leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.41,0:55:42.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Poor fella. Trash truck comes at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.50,0:55:44.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then it's off to the dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.84,0:55:47.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I appreciate your concern, old-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.26,0:55:50.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we have a kid waiting for us. Now, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.43,0:55:53.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you'd help us, one toy to another, I 'd sure be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.56,0:55:57.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're gonna get out,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.02,0:55:59.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,first thing you gotta get through's the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.44,0:56:04.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Locked, every night. Inside and out. Keys are left on a hook in the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.77,0:56:05.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got it. What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.90,0:56:08.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lotso has trucks patrolling all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.61,0:56:10.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hallway, lobby, playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.61,0:56:11.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah. What about the wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.78,0:56:15.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eight-feet high. Cinder block. No way through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.20,0:56:16.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You go over or under.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.83,0:56:18.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it? Doesn't seem so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.79,0:56:21.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not. Your real problem's the monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.75,0:56:25.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,The monkey's the eye in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.46,0:56:27.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,He sees everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.88,0:56:29.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Classrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.14,0:56:41.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hallways.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:52.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even the playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:03.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can unlock doors, sneak past guards, climb the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.33,0:57:07.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,but if you don't take out that monkey, you ain't going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.04,0:57:11.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You wanna get out of here? Get rid of that monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.47,0:57:14.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Recess! Come on, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.81,0:57:21.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.89,0:57:24.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? - Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.85,0:57:25.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.35,0:57:28.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey, hey, hey, buddy! - Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.82,0:57:31.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're alive! - 'Course I 'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.32,0:57:35.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, my hat! Wait, where's Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:36.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lotso did something to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.95,0:57:39.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,He thinks he's a real Space Ranger again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.20,0:57:40.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no. - Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.99,0:57:42.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Return of the astro-nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.91,0:57:47.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, we were wrong to leave Andy. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.75,0:57:50.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jessie's right, Woody. She was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.21,0:57:53.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's my fault for leaving you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.55,0:57:55.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,From now on, we stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.88,0:57:57.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,But Andy's leavin' for college.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.72,0:57:59.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,College? Hog-tie the mailman!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.68,0:58:02.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta get you home before Andy leaves tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.39,0:58:03.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow? But that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.02,0:58:06.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,It means we're busting out of here, tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.10,0:58:08.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? Impossible! - But there's no way out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.40,0:58:11.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, there is one way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.94,0:58:13.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,One way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.49,0:58:17.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's what we're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.08,0:58:25.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Springy dog. - Present.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.58,0:58:27.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Green guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.25,0:58:29.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Cowgirl. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.79,0:58:30.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.09,0:58:33.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Piggy bank. - Y o.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.17,0:58:35.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tyrannosaurus. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.51,0:58:38.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Barbie. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.59,0:58:40.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Potato Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.14,0:58:42.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Potato Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.72,0:58:46.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Tuberous root-man! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.48,0:58:48.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.48,0:58:51.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.04,0:59:06.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Little late for a stroll, eh, Potato Head?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.00,0:59:09.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's Mr. Potato Head to you, smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.92,0:59:13.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well. You're turning out to be quite the troublemaker, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.46,0:59:16.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you think you were gonna do? Waltz right out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.13,0:59:17.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I would 've got away with it, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.47,0:59:19.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,if it weren't for you meddling toys!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.13,0:59:20.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You ascot- wearing pink- noser!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.89,0:59:22.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not a toy! You're an accessory!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.05,0:59:25.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a purse with legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.31,0:59:26.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take him back to the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.98,0:59:29.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No, not the box! I 'm sorry. I didn't mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.84,0:59:31.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like ascots.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.40,0:59:33.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really. No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.19,0:59:35.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.48,0:59:39.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good work, Lightyear. All right, resume your space-guy-thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.49,0:59:41.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, well-@groomed man!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.95,0:59:44.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ken! Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.20,0:59:48.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.62,0:59:52.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't take it here, Ken. I wanna go to the Butterfly Room. With you!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.13,0:59:53.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you should 've thought of that yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.17,0:59:55.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.50,0:59:58.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna be with you, Ken, I do. In your Dream House.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.72,1:00:02.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please take me away from this! Take me away!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.55,1:00:04.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darn it, Barbie!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:07.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, but things are complicated around here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.68,1:00:10.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You gotta do what I say. - I will, Ken! I promise!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.85,1:00:15.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. I 'll do anything! I 'll change your diapers!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.65,1:01:04.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go get the tape!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.08,1:01:13.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,And this is where the magic happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.96,1:01:16.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at all your clothes!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.38,1:01:18.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you never brought me up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.59,1:01:20.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tennis whites? Mission to Mars! - I know, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.84,1:01:22.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check this out! Kung fu fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.63,1:01:25.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Campus hero with matching sports pennant, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.89,1:01:28.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flower power! Oh, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.93,1:01:33.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one appreciates clothes here, Barbie. No one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.10,1:01:38.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ken, would you model a few outfits for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.94,1:01:40.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a few?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.06,1:02:12.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go get the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.64,1:02:14.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is it, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.85,1:02:16.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's the key? Where's the key? Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.49,1:02:29.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.45,1:02:32.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told you, keep your hands off of my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.74,1:02:34.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Make a move, porky!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.29,1:02:37.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! No fighting! Break it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.00,1:02:42.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey! Hey! - Take that, walnut-brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.30,1:02:43.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,No wonder you're extinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.26,1:02:46.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't hit each other. That's my job!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.64,1:02:52.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Prison riot!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.27,1:02:56.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the tortilla.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.27,1:03:38.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Ready? - Ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.73,1:03:47.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barbie?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.03,1:03:52.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,No more games, Ken! What did Lotso do to Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.78,1:03:54.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,And how do we switch him back?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.12,1:03:56.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't make me talk. You can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.75,1:03:59.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I 'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.13,1:04:53.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Hawaiian surf trunks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.89,1:04:56.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barbie! Those were vintage!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.80,1:04:58.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay. All right, go ahead, rip 'em, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.77,1:05:00.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're a dime a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.31,1:05:01.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Glitter tux.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.27,1:05:06.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Who cares? Sequins are tacky. Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.32,1:05:08.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,A Nehru jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.23,1:05:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barbie! Not the Nehru.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.49,1:05:13.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is from what, 1967?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.32,1:05:14.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,The groovy formal collection, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.20,1:05:18.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What a shame. - Oh, no, no, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.99,1:05:20.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's an instruction manual!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.75,1:05:24.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lotso switched Buzz to Demo mode!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.46,1:05:27.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's that manual?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.50,1:05:31.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know why this couldn't wait until morning, Ken,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.88,1:05:33.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,but here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.90,1:05:48.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's takin' so doggone long?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.40,1:05:53.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,So how do we fix Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.88,1:06:13.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at, feathers?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.55,1:06:16.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.22,1:06:23.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fly away, you coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.89,1:06:28.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just great.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.19,1:06:36.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Prison riot!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.82,1:06:38.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mayday! Mayday! - Give it up. No one can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.24,1:06:42.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - I said, "No one can hear you."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.99,1:06:45.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - He said, "No one can..."
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.33,1:06:46.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shush! Will you be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.50,1:06:48.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! You're back!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.50,1:06:53.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop him! Don't let him get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.88,1:06:56.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Star Command! I 've been taken hostage by my own prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.93,1:07:00.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick! Open his back. There's a switch!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.80,1:07:02.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unhand me, Zurg scum!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.64,1:07:05.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Galactic Courts will show you no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.43,1:07:08.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not working. Why is it not working? Where's the manual?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.77,1:07:11.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here we go! There should be a little hole under the switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.44,1:07:14.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Little hole, got it! - "To reset your Buzz Lightyear,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.15,1:07:16.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- "insert paperclip..." - Rex, use your finger!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.32,1:07:17.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.11,1:07:19.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, now what? - All right, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.82,1:07:22.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Caution. Do not hold button for more than five seconds."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.12,1:07:27.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.50,1:07:34.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.00,1:07:37.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.17,1:07:39.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now what did you do? - I just did what you told me!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.65,1:07:42.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.05,1:07:45.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.10,1:07:46.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.48,1:07:49.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Amigos! We're all amigos.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.00,1:07:53.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.87,1:07:56.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.82,1:07:58.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,We gotta switch him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.15,1:08:01.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, how do we do that? - I don't know. That part's in Spanish.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.16,1:08:04.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this. Come on, El Buzzo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.03,1:08:06.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.03,1:08:07.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.33,1:08:09.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good luck, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.75,1:08:17.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.51,1:08:21.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.80,1:08:24.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.35,1:08:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Things got complicated. - Where's Potato Head?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.68,1:08:28.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.52,1:08:31.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.70,1:08:35.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.90,1:08:39.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.86,1:08:42.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you fix Buzz?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.03,1:08:44.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sort of. - Behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.82,1:08:46.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.70,1:08:52.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,You would not believe what I 've been through tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.71,1:08:54.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Darling! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.54,1:08:57.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel fresh. Healthy. It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.13,1:09:00.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've lost weight. And so tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.09,1:09:04.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a sight for detachable eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.93,1:09:10.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,All clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.60,1:09:16.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.27,1:09:19.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.07,1:09:25.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Back up. Back up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.08,1:09:33.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.93,1:10:42.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.33,1:10:45.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.53,1:10:48.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.58,1:10:52.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.83,1:10:56.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.50,1:10:58.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.42,1:11:07.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, come here. Give me a lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.40,1:11:12.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.76,1:11:19.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.69,1:11:21.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Buzz. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.82,1:11:28.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is it safe? - I guess I 'll find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.37,1:11:37.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody? You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.87,1:11:40.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on down. But not all at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.37,1:11:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What did he say? - I think he said, "All at once."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.34,1:11:43.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No. No, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.71,1:11:45.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Geronimo! - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.88,1:11:49.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Jess.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.42,1:11:51.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.72,1:11:52.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Almost there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.47,1:11:55.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Slink, you think you can make it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.47,1:11:58.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I might be old, but I still got a spring in my step.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.15,1:12:03.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He did it! - All right, Slinkykins.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.11,1:12:04.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, climb across.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.90,1:12:09.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,You lost, little doggie?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.24,1:12:15.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, well. Look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.79,1:12:25.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.92,1:12:28.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,They broke me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.30,1:12:31.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are y'all doing? Running back to your kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.72,1:12:33.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,He don't want you no more.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.84,1:12:35.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's a lie. - Is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.60,1:12:37.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me this, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.35,1:12:40.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,If your kid loves you so much, why is he leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.94,1:12:42.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think you're special, cowboy?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.19,1:12:47.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're a piece of plastic. You were made to be thrown away.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.94,1:12:50.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.53,1:12:59.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, we need toys in our Caterpillar Room
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.83,1:13:02.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,and you need to avoid that truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.58,1:13:06.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come on back, join our family again?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.54,1:13:10.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't a family! It's a prison! You're a liar and a bully!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.51,1:13:14.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I 'd rather rot in this dumpster than join any family of yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.55,1:13:18.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jessie's right! Authority should derive from the consent of the governed,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.35,1:13:19.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,not from the threat of force.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.02,1:13:22.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.85,1:13:27.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barbie! Wait! Don't do this, Lotso.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.98,1:13:32.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's a Barbie doll, Ken. There's a hundred million just like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.07,1:13:34.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not to me, there's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.95,1:13:38.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine. Then why don't you join her!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.54,1:13:42.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ken!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.00,1:13:44.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.25,1:13:47.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sunnyside could be cool and groovy if we treated each other fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.13,1:13:50.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Lotso. He's made us into a pyramid,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.96,1:13:52.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,and he put himself on top!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.72,1:13:54.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone concur with Ken?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.89,1:14:00.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't throw you away. Your kid did.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.68,1:14:03.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ain't one kid ever loved a toy, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.35,1:14:05.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Chew on that when you're at the dump.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.35,1:14:07.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! What about Daisy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.61,1:14:11.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.40,1:14:14.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Daisy? You used to do everything with her?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.11,1:14:16.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah? Then she threw us out. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.61,1:14:18.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She lost you. - She replaced us!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.03,1:14:20.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,She replaced you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.95,1:14:22.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if you couldn't have her then no one could.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.04,1:14:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,You lied to Big Baby and you've been lying ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.87,1:14:29.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where'd you get that? - She loved you, Lotso.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.34,1:14:30.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,She never loved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.59,1:14:32.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,As much as any kid ever loved a toy.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.80,1:14:37.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.18,1:14:40.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? You want your mommy back?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.76,1:14:44.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,She never loved you. Don't be such a baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.98,1:14:48.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Push 'em in. All of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.40,1:14:52.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when you dummies try to think.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.48,1:14:57.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're all just trash, waiting to be thrown away! That's all a toy is!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.86,1:15:01.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it! Put me down, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.91,1:15:06.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No! Wait a minute! Big Baby, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.46,1:15:11.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's gone! - Holy cow.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.80,1:15:18.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.02,1:15:26.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.06,1:15:26.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.60,1:15:31.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.15,1:15:37.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.28,1:15:41.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.83,1:15:43.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barbie, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.46,1:15:49.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.50,1:15:54.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.09,1:16:01.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Is everyone okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.30,1:16:04.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course not, you imbecile. We're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.14,1:16:07.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone, go to Buzz. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.10,1:16:12.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,We all here? Slinky? Rex?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.40,1:16:18.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Against the wall, everybody. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.80,1:16:20.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.87,1:16:21.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.17,1:16:33.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll never make it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.05,1:16:44.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.85,1:16:49.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.94,1:16:59.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Anyone see him? - Over here, y'all. I found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.41,1:17:04.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.70,1:17:08.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! Buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.63,1:17:19.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,That wasn't me, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.80,1:17:23.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, you're back! You're back, you're back, you're back, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.88,1:17:26.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I 'm back. Where have I been?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.85,1:17:28.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beyond infinity, Space Ranger.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.06,1:17:32.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! So where are we now?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.31,1:17:34.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,In a garbage truck on the way to the dump!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.88,1:17:38.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.87,1:17:49.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on, we're going in!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.38,1:18:06.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got all your pieces?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.93,1:18:08.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,The claw!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.30,1:18:12.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- My babies! - Hey, guys! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.56,1:18:14.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.28,1:18:22.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.62,1:18:37.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.12,1:18:38.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll be okay if we stay togeth...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.13,1:18:41.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody! - Slinky!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.30,1:18:45.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a magnet! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.80,1:18:48.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Slink, we'll get you down.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.26,1:18:49.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,You might wanna take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.97,1:18:55.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick! Grab something metal!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.81,1:19:02.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You heard the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.11,1:19:07.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.53,1:19:14.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Help me. I 'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.08,1:19:17.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help, please! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.33,1:19:19.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.00,1:19:23.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you. - Don't thank me yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.59,1:19:27.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.39,1:19:38.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.52,1:19:45.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.98,1:19:47.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're all in this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.49,1:19:48.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right, guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.07,1:19:51.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.37,1:19:53.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody! Down here!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.20,1:19:58.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody! - Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.29,1:20:02.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody, look. I can see daylight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.63,1:20:04.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.25,1:20:06.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.05,1:20:08.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's daylight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.89,1:20:16.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.72,1:20:28.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.78,1:20:36.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sheriff! The button! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.12,1:20:37.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.33,1:20:41.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go. Go! Hit the button!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.96,1:20:50.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.34,1:20:55.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just push it! Push it! - Push it!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.97,1:20:59.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's your kid now, Sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.89,1:21:01.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.23,1:21:02.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lotso!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.56,1:21:05.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.91,1:21:23.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rex!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.92,1:21:32.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz! What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.50,1:22:54.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,The claw.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.20,1:23:25.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know all that bad stuff I said about Andy's attic?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.16,1:23:26.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.75,1:23:28.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're darn tootin'. - You said it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.88,1:23:37.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, darling. You were so brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.22,1:23:42.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You saved our lives. - And we are eternally grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.93,1:23:45.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,My boys!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.31,1:23:46.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.98,1:23:49.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where's that fur ball Lotso?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.14,1:23:51.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I 'd like to loosen his stitchin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.44,1:23:54.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forget it, guys. He's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.41,1:24:04.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey! - What you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.95,1:24:07.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I had me one of these when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.41,1:24:09.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.92,1:24:17.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy. You might wanna keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.26,1:24:25.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Woody. We gotta get you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.81,1:24:28.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's right, college boy. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.10,1:24:30.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,What about you guys? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.65,1:24:33.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,maybe the attic's not such a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.44,1:24:39.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're Andy's toys, Woody. - We'll be there for him, together.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.82,1:24:43.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I just hope he hasn't left yet. - Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.20,1:24:44.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, I 'll check!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.99,1:24:48.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy's still packing. But he's almost done!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.04,1:24:52.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He lives halfway across town. - We'll never get there in time!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.60,1:25:11.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on, Buster. - Is that it, honey? You got everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.14,1:25:12.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just a few more boxes in my room.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.89,1:25:13.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.48,1:25:18.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's enough. That's enough. That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.78,1:25:20.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Go. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.12,1:25:30.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. All clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.21,1:25:40.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.89,1:25:48.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- There you go. - Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.06,1:25:56.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- This isn't goodbye. - Hey, Woody. Have fun at college.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.44,1:25:58.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but not too much fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.31,1:26:02.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Woody, take care of Andy. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.32,1:26:04.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's a good kid. Tell him to get a haircut.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.78,1:26:06.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.07,1:26:10.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jessie, you'll be okay in the attic?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.29,1:26:14.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,'Course I will. Besides, I know about
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.46,1:26:17.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Buzz's Spanish mode. - My what?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.13,1:26:18.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Honey, you want some food for the road?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.79,1:26:19.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'll get something on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.84,1:26:23.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know where to find us, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.40,1:26:39.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you say goodbye to Molly?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.86,1:26:42.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom, we've said goodbye like 10 times.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.20,1:26:47.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.54,1:26:56.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.33,1:27:00.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.30,1:27:05.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wish I could always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.01,1:27:09.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You will be, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.24,1:27:27.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you gonna say goodbye to Buster?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.24,1:27:29.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course I am. Who's a good doggy?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.53,1:27:32.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's a good doggy? I 'm gonna miss you. I 'm gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.62,1:27:40.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I 'm gonna miss you. - Don't, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.75,1:27:46.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good boy. He's telling you to go already.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.46,1:27:47.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Get the rest of your things.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.01,1:27:51.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Buster. Now don't let Molly near my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.73,1:27:58.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.78,1:28:09.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom! So, you really think I should donate these?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.11,1:28:13.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's up to you, honey. Whatever you wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.89,1:28:43.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Don't go in there! The bakery is haunted!"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.81,1:28:47.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Are you crazy? You'll wake up all the ghosts."
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.19,1:28:49.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Look out! The ghosts are throwing pies!"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.11,1:28:53.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.12,1:28:55.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Andy? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.58,1:28:57.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.45,1:28:59.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I hear you're off to college.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.41,1:29:01.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Right now, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.41,1:29:03.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what can we do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.42,1:29:05.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have some toys here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.34,1:29:07.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.67,1:29:10.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, you're Bonnie?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.63,1:29:12.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'm Andy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.64,1:29:16.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone told me you're really good with toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.39,1:29:20.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,These are mine, but I 'm going away now,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.64,1:29:25.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,so I need someone really special to play with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.07,1:29:35.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Jessie, the roughest, toughest cowgirl in the whole West.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.78,1:29:39.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,She loves critters, but none more than her best pal, Bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.00,1:29:44.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.35,1:30:02.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Rex, the meanest, most terrifying dinosaur who ever lived!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.98,1:30:12.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Potato Heads. Mr. And Mrs. You gotta keep 'em together,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.32,1:30:14.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,'cause they're madly in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.78,1:30:18.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now Slinky here is as loyal as any dog you could want.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.49,1:30:21.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,And Hamm, he'll keep your money safe,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.79,1:30:26.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,but he's also one of the most dastardly villains of all time, evil Dr. Pork Chop.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.92,1:30:32.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,These little dudes are from a strange alien world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.26,1:30:34.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pizza Planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.26,1:30:37.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,And this
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.97,1:30:43.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,is Buzz Lightyear, the coolest toy ever!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.68,1:30:46.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, he can fly and shoot lasers!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.02,1:30:50.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's sworn to protect the galaxy from the evil Emperor Zurg.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.11,1:30:54.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,To infinity and beyond!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.86,1:30:58.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, you gotta promise to take good care of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.87,1:31:04.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,They mean a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.38,1:31:11.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,My cowboy!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.42,1:31:17.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Woody? What's he doing in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.89,1:31:21.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- "There's a snake in my boot." - Wha?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.56,1:31:25.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a snake in my boot.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.86,1:31:44.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, Woody, he's been my pal for as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.37,1:31:47.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's brave, like a cowboy should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.58,1:31:49.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,And kind. And smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.58,1:31:56.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,But the thing that makes Woody special is he'll never give up on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.26,1:31:58.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.26,1:32:01.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll be there for you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.81,1:32:08.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think you can take care of him for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.60,1:32:10.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.99,1:32:25.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Dr. Pork Chop's attacking the haunted bakery!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.62,1:32:28.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ghosts are getting away. Woody'll stop 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.41,1:32:29.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz Lightyear to the rescue!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.08,1:32:32.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,And we'll actually need the rocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.25,1:32:35.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're getting away! Come on, Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.34,1:32:41.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to get in the spaceship. The volcano is gonna erupt.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.97,1:32:44.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look! They're being attacked by a real dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.85,1:32:46.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can eat my poisonous scones!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.31,1:32:48.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. And Mrs. Potato Head are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.56,1:32:50.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get on, Woody.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.94,1:32:53.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's my friend Woody.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.44,1:32:57.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, hurry! Get your extra turbo booster.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.72,1:33:26.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.27,1:33:32.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, Mommy. They're all playing together.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.85,1:33:34.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's get some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.53,1:33:50.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,So long, partner.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.21,1:33:58.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Buzz. You haven't met Bonnie's toys yet. Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.67,1:34:01.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna love them. Buzz, this is Dolly.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.79,1:34:33.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,New toys!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.68,1:34:46.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Noses.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.96,1:36:10.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,"So I guess you could say Sunnyside is sunny once again!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.34,1:36:13.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Hope to hear from you soon. We're all super excited about your new home.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.93,1:36:16.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Hugs and kisses to everyone."
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.43,1:36:20.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,That Barbie has some nice handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.35,1:36:24.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Buzz, Barbie didn't write this.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.69,1:36:27.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Grab the sword! - I got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.94,1:36:29.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Okay, go for the... - Triple bonus!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.20,1:36:30.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Watch out! - We got the cloak of darkness!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.36,1:36:33.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Run, run! - My arms are never long enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.20,1:36:35.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I 'll do it! This is it! This is it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.20,1:36:37.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes! - We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.87,1:36:39.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,High-five! Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.33,1:36:45.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it's official. You guys made the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.38,1:36:48.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Look at this! - Golly bob howdy! That's me!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.55,1:36:51.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're all up here! Hey, Chuckles, lookin' good.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.93,1:36:54.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she really got your smile.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.60,1:37:03.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.90,1:37:07.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told you kids! Stay out of my butt!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.78,1:37:12.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,But soft, what light through yonder window breaks?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.57,1:37:15.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Romeo, o Romeo, wherefore art thou Romeo?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.49,1:37:18.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next season, we're doing Cats.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.62,1:37:21.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or might I suggest Hamlet?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.33,1:37:25.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Detached wing. Cosmetic damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.58,1:37:27.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing a little duct tape can't fix.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.68,1:37:40.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know what came over me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.10,1:37:44.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just go with it, Buzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:59.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,《玩具总动员3》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:10.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,钱,钱,钱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:20.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天你和正义有个约会,独眼巴特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.45,0:01:23.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,真糟糕,警长,我已经结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:26.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,独眼贝蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:43.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,先生,你的东西掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:45.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 洁西 - 束手就擒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:47.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的犯罪生涯到头了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.73,0:01:49.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我总想和爆炸来场约会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.70,0:02:01.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:06.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不想提前离场,可我们的车来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:14.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,是追我还是救这些孩子呢,警长,选一个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:19.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,再快一点,红心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:26.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,稳住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:33.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:55.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:06.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,真高兴我赶上火车了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.89,0:03:08.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,该去抓罪犯了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:11.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙,浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,一飞冲天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.33,0:03:31.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你抓不住我的,警长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的警卫狗有自带力场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:46.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的恐龙专吃力场狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:08.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,邪恶博士猪排
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:13.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,要称呼我邪恶博士猪排先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:17.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,(金刚猴阵)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:57.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,用你的激光枪射我的胸章
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,伍迪,那会杀了你的,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:06.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要进监狱了,巴特,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:09.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.01,0:05:12.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事儿,继续玩吧,就当我不在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,茉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:17.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,妈妈,来自外太空的50英尺巨婴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.06,0:05:20.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,她会摧毁一切,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.86,0:05:24.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯特,出来,红灯是在录像吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:27.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,和茉莉说生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:31.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 生日快乐 - 真乖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:37.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你都长这么高了 - 是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:47.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经尽快赶来了,巴斯,注意后面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道了,伍迪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年前来救援
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:55.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,干的好,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:22.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,快点,所有人各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,我的那只眼睛不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:27.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁的脚在我脸上 - 是我的,还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救了我们,感激不尽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:33.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,不介意我挤在你旁边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:37.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,介意,不,我为什么要介意我挤在你旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:39.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿太热了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:40.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,你们拿到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:46.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,任务完成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:47.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:56.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟们,我们要抓住这次机会,大家准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:58.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好了,伍迪,行动
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,巴斯,打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,目标正在接近
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:18.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像我们演习的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:38.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好,有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.66,0:07:41.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,茉莉,别进我房间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:43.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:45.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是谁动了我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.67,0:07:47.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,还真是顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:07:58.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他拿起我了,他真的拿起我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,太悲剧了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:03.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,骗谁呢,他已经17岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:05.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,他再也不会和我们一起玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:10.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要开个会,所有的玩具都要参加
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:15.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,又开会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:17.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样,弹簧狗,叫大家开会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:19.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,我们都在这
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:21.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,首先,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.33,0:08:25.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都知道"游戏演习"是一次大胆的尝试
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.21,0:08:27.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,更像一次失败的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:31.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我们常说我们的工作不是被玩,而是为了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.59,0:08:33.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了陪着安迪,我们知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:35.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还以再试一次,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.14,0:08:39.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说,伙计们,我们收工了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:44.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪马上就要上大学了,那是我们最后的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:46.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们马上就要进阁楼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,随时拿好你们的零件
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:52.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,备件,电池,任何合理过渡期需要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.11,0:08:55.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,合理过渡,你还不明白吗,我们完了,一切都结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:58.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样,伙计们,我们都知道这一天迟早会来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,现在不就是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:03.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,每个玩具都有这一天,没人想看到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:04.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,你们在干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:08.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,战争结束了,我们要去其他地方继续战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 其他地方 - 你是要擅离职守吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:13.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们完成了任务,安迪长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:15.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,面对现实吧,如果垃圾袋拿来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.59,0:09:17.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,那我们肯定是第一个进去的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:19.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 垃圾袋 - 谁说垃圾袋了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:24.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,很荣幸能和你们并肩作战,祝你们好运
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.69,0:09:27.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们也会有这么一天的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:29.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:31.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们要被丢掉了吗 - 不,没人会被丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:32.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们要被抛弃了 - 我们会没事的,洁西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:37.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那队长为什么要离开 - 我们要离开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:40.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我还以为我们要去阁楼呢 - 我讨厌这种不安的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一等,安静
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.95,0:09:46.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人会被丢掉,好吗,我们都还在这
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:50.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,一路走来,我们是失去过朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:53.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 企鹅威兹,画板,还有 - 牧羊女
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:58.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,还有她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:01.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的好玩具都有新主人了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:05.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是每一次的后院拍卖会和大扫除,安迪都留下了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,他肯定很在乎我们,不然我们就不会在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你等着看,安迪会让我们呆在阁楼里,那儿安全又舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.78,0:10:16.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们会一直在一起 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:18.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,那有游戏,有书,还有,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:21.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 赛车跑道 - 赛车跑道,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:24.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还有旧电视 - 没错,旧电视
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:28.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有作圣诞装饰的那些伙计,他们很有意思的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.96,0:10:30.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:34.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许有一天,如果运气好的话,安迪会有他自己的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:36.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他就又能和我们一起玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会一直在那等他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:41.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,伙计们,把自己的零件都带好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.97,0:10:44.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备迎接新的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:46.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,最好能找到我的另一只眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:48.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次你把它丢哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.39,0:10:51.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个又黑又脏的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:54.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,看看我们在网上值多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:58.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,安迪会照顾好我们的,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:25.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你保证吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:28.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道,巴斯,我还能说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管发生什么,最起码我们都会在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙,浩瀚无垠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:38.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 能把你的音响给我吗 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么不行 - 我要带走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 能把你的电脑给我吗 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:50.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的游戏机呢 - 想都别想,茉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:52.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,安迪,我们开始干活吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:56.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有你不会带去上大学的,要么放进阁楼,要么丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:59.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈,我星期五才走呢 - 来吧,今天就开始整理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 你瞧,很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:05.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,滑板,带去大学,小联盟奖杯,也许送上阁楼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:08.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,苹果核,丢掉,剩下的你来收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么还留着这些玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,茉莉,出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,三天后就是我的房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:17.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,茉莉,你也有事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:18.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的玩具太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.36,0:12:21.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以送走一些给其他孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:22.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪些孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:25.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,幼儿园的孩子,他们一直需要捐赠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:26.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么是幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:27.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 没有可是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:31.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把要捐的玩具挑出来,我顺路带给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,可怜的芭比
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:45.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要巡洋舰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:48.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪,快点,你要做决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,比如什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,比如你要把这些玩具怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:52.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不要把它们也捐出去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.85,0:12:54.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 或者放在网上拍卖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.69,0:12:56.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈,没人想要这些旧玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:12:58.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,都只是废品
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:13:00.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,你能留到星期五
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:03.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有不带去大学或送进阁楼的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:07.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 都会被丢掉 - 随你心意,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我们要被丢掉了,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:01.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,还问怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要帮忙吗 - 我自己能行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:19.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:21.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我走了你会想我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:24.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 如果我说不,我还能住你的房间吗 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.28,0:14:25.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,那好吧,我想你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:27.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喘不上来气了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:30.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真不敢相信 - 安静,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:42.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:47.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些不是垃圾,那些不是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:49.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,想想办法,伍迪,快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:53.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯特,过来,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:00.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,小伙子,到街上去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.86,0:15:06.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,巴斯特,不
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:11.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,起来,巴斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们在街上 - 我就知道是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:30.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们,使劲拉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:43.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 扯不破 - 算了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:46.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪,这是三层高密度聚乙烯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:47.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,总能找到办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:49.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪不要我们了,有什么意义?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:50.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,尖端,尖头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,推,快推
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:57.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听见了垃圾车的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:00.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,越来越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:39.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,洁西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:50.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安迪不要我们了 - 就像扔垃圾一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:53.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 废品,他叫我们废品 - 他怎么能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:56.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,这没道理
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:59.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我早该知道,又是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:02.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 队长是对的 - 没错,伍迪错了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:04.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一等,没时间歇斯底里了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:06.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在正是歇斯底里的好时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:08.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们应该歇斯底里吗 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:10.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 可现在不是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.03,0:17:14.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们,有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.33,0:17:22.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.62,0:17:27.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 几年前我们就该这么做了 - 等等,洁西,伍迪怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:30.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,他没事,巴斯,安迪会带他去大学的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.63,0:17:31.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我们得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:34.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是对的,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.97,0:17:37.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯 - 伍迪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.30,0:17:40.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事,你们不知道这盒子是要捐给幼儿园的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:42.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,一切尽在掌握,我们有个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:43.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要去幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:46.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,幼儿园,什么,你们都疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:49.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没看见吗,安迪把我们扔了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不是,他要把你们放进阁楼的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,阁楼,那我们怎么会在街上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:56.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,那只是个误会,安迪的妈妈以为你们是垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,是安迪把我们放进了垃圾袋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:00.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还叫我们废品
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道看起来很糟,可是伙计们,你们一定要相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然,大学生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:09.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪有自己的生活了,伍迪,我们也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:13.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,离开这个盒子,所有人,马上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:16.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,巴斯,帮帮忙,我们离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:19.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,等一下,我们要弄清楚怎么样对大家最好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:27.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,好极了,我们再也回不来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.61,0:18:39.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的,芭比,你会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.53,0:18:44.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,茉莉不和我玩很多年了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:48.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我还是不敢相信她把我丢掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:51.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大家都一样 - 好吧,所有人听着
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:54.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还能回到安迪身边,不过我们得动作快点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,在到家之前我们要藏在座位下面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:57.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,别浪费精力了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:58.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪不要我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:01.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要把你们放进阁楼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,他把我们留在了街上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:06.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好了,你们都冷静一下 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.43,0:19:08.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就去看看幼儿园什么样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:11.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了,那儿什么样啊 - 幼儿园是悲伤和寂寞的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:15.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,充满了没有主人的旧玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:19.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还真会安慰人 - 等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.86,0:19:23.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,到那儿你们就知道了,到时候你们会哭着要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.02,0:19:26.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,(阳光幼儿园)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们能看见什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有游乐场 - 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:44.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走运了,红心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,还真是悲伤和寂寞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:48.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静,我们要透过现象看本质
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:50.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,本质,这地方完美
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:54.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,这儿很不错,看见了吗,门上有彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.44,0:20:00.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 哇!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:01.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.03,0:20:04.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我带来了些旧玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:08.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是邦尼吗 - 都这么大了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:10.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快打招呼,宝贝 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的孩子怎么样了,茉莉和安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:16.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,不再是孩子了,安迪星期五就要上大学了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 难以置信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:21.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你确定他们不要了吗 - 这些他们都不玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:25.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你看到小孩子了吗 - 她要带我们去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:34.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你瞧 - 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:36.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.82,0:20:43.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:45.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,下课了,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:58.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们现在该怎么办 - 我们应该回安迪那
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.54,0:21:01.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁看见出口了吗 - 出口,切,我们等着被孩子们玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心,这些玩具会嫉妒新来的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要看一眼 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:06.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 雷克斯 - 到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:13.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,新玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:21.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好,很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.94,0:21:23.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年,为您服务
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,天呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,我可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:36.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,利爪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:47.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎你们,我就觉得听到了新声音
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:52.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到阳光幼儿园,我是抱抱熊罗梭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:54.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,但请叫我罗梭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:56.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是巴斯光年,我们,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:01.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你首先应该了解的是,我热爱拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:04.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看你们大家,你们今天一定过得不容易吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:06.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们现在安全了,这里都是没人要的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.91,0:22:13.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,被抛弃的,被捐赠的,在后院被拍卖,转手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.54,0:22:16.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者就直接丢掉了,可是等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:20.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们会发现被捐赠是你们最好的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:24.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭先生,他们每天都会玩玩具吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:27.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,一整天,一星期五天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:29.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,可如果孩子们长大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:31.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:34.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,等这些孩子们长大了,就会有一批新孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.93,0:22:37.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,当他们长大了,又有新的孩子代替他们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:42.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你永远不会被嫌弃,不会被遗弃,或者被忽视
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:45.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有主人就不会伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.53,0:22:50.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真是奇迹 - 你还想让我们回安迪那吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.03,0:22:52.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我们是安迪的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:55.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是被这个安迪捐了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:58.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是他的损失,警长,他不能再伤害你了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:23:00.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 - 先把你们安顿一下,肯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.08,0:23:05.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,这家伙哪去了,肯,有新玩具来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:07.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,马上下来,罗梭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:14.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好和肯一起开始梦幻之旅了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:17.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,带新朋友们去看看他们的新家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.64,0:23:19.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,伙计们,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.49,0:23:30.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫肯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是芭比,我们见过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:36.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,见过我会记得的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:39.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢你的长袜 - 好酷的领巾
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.66,0:23:42.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,肯,孩子们要回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:45.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就开始,罗梭,这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:50.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,今后的日子值得期待,小家伙们总是很喜欢新玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.22,0:23:53.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真是好心的熊 - 他闻起来像草莓
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.22,0:23:57.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们,我要告诉大家,这里有
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.06,0:23:59.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,玩具需要的任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.02,0:24:01.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,零件,强力胶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.89,0:24:05.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,很多的新电池,足以撑死一头饥饿的河马
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:07.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你以为自己已经老了 - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.73,0:24:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:13.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的休养所会让你立刻返老还童
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.87,0:24:17.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.41,0:24:20.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯的梦幻小屋,这里有舞厅,越野车
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.75,0:24:23.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有一间更衣室
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.21,0:24:26.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么都有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.59,0:24:29.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,但还需要一位女主人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.76,0:24:35.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你们需要什么,可以来找我,我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.39,0:24:40.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,大宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.27,0:24:44.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,来认识我们的新朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.48,0:24:47.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子,我们一起被扔了,我和他
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.02,0:24:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,被同一个主人抛弃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.73,0:24:53.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过在这我们不需要主人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.24,0:24:56.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是自己的主人,我们自己掌握命运
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.62,0:24:58.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,自己控制我们的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:00.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心水坑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.70,0:25:04.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是你们的家了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:06.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,毛毛虫屋
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.75,0:25:09.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看看这啊 - 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.75,0:25:11.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,娘咧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.88,0:25:13.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,中奖了,宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:15.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可爱的小狗 - 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:16.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们好 - 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.93,0:25:20.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.31,0:25:25.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了,小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.64,0:25:28.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,多久没有人找你们玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:29.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,好多年了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.61,0:25:33.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只用等几分钟,铃一响
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:36.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们梦寐以求的游戏时间就到了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.45,0:25:39.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,游戏,真正的游戏,我都等不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.37,0:25:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,请大家原谅,我们要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.33,0:25:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到阳光幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.46,0:25:45.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 保重,粉嘟嘟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.58,0:25:47.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 罗梭先生,再见,谢谢你 - 谢谢,伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.21,0:25:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们还能再见面吗 - 今晚见
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.46,0:25:51.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 在梦中 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.63,0:25:54.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯,我们该走了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:56.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,跟我走吧,住进我的梦幻小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.97,0:25:58.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这很疯狂,我知道我们才刚刚见面
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.93,0:26:00.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不知道我在《特种部队》里的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.80,0:26:02.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,可每当我看着你,我觉得我们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.97,0:26:05.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 天生一对 - 天生一对
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.81,0:26:07.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.06,0:26:09.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 肯, - 我来了,罗梭
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.23,0:26:13.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我太激动了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.66,0:26:21.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,听起来像上孩子们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.91,0:26:25.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们又能被孩子们玩了,时间怎么不能过的再快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.45,0:26:26.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,外面有多少孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:28.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的声音真好听
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.76,0:26:38.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,这不错,我承认
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:41.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,可我们要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.18,0:26:43.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,我们要在这开始新生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.89,0:26:46.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,又有逗孩子们开心的机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.52,0:26:49.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你干吗不留下来 - 是啊,伍迪,留下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.35,0:26:50.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜托,伍迪 - 你又能和孩子们玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:51.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我做不到 - 留下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.86,0:26:53.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你会成为其他孩子的开心果 - 不行,伙计们,真的不行
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.86,0:26:58.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经有一个能让其开心的孩子了,你们也有,他就是安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.86,0:27:02.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管他想带我去大学或者放进阁楼里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.37,0:27:04.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的工作就是为了他待在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.04,0:27:06.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在,我要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:09.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,想和我一起走的,我热烈欢迎,走吧,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.88,0:27:15.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.17,0:27:20.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,陪伴安迪成长的任务已经完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.64,0:27:22.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.80,0:27:24.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在重要的是我们大家在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.93,0:27:28.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果不是安迪,我们都不可能在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.18,0:27:30.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看你的靴子,巴斯,还有你,洁西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.73,0:27:31.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,上面写着谁的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.23,0:27:36.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许安迪不在乎我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.57,0:27:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,他当然在乎,他在乎你们大家
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.15,0:27:40.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,他要把你们放进阁楼,我看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.90,0:27:42.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不能现在背叛他
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.91,0:27:47.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,醒醒吧,都结束了,安迪长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.96,0:27:51.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.79,0:27:55.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信你们这么自私
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.59,0:28:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,缘分尽了是吗,在一起经历了那么多之后
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.49,0:28:25.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,不,你留在这
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.12,0:28:30.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,不,我说了留下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:34.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.25,0:28:38.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想你一个人留在阁楼里,好吗,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:45.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,邦尼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.89,0:28:48.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.35,0:28:53.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,邦尼,你在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.87,0:29:16.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好,很好,不
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:57.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么,搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.46,0:30:01.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.13,0:30:05.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 邦尼 - 风信子,海扇壳
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.51,0:30:08.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这儿,来吧,宝贝,该回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.91,0:30:34.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.29,0:31:18.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,一飞冲天
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:22.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,风信子,海扇壳,我们大家一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.84,0:31:31.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我最信赖的助手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.30,0:31:33.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 邦尼 - 来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.64,0:31:38.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,这下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.99,0:31:52.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都没事的,红心
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.99,0:31:55.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪会带上伍迪一起去大学,那正是他想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.83,0:31:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,他疯了,大学里可容不下一个玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.50,0:32:00.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,玩具是为了玩耍
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:03.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,说到玩耍,孩子们在排队啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:05.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有多少 - 有好多
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.34,0:32:06.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我等不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.67,0:32:08.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.85,0:32:24.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,终于有人会找我玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.81,0:32:27.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 雷克斯 - 孩子们来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.41,0:33:24.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,有只蛇在我的靴子里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.12,0:33:29.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,加入你们可以,但我要先唱首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.54,0:33:30.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,一位警长
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.51,0:33:34.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,让开,刺猬罗宾先生
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.17,0:33:36.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有位客人,来点咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.05,0:33:42.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,喝一点对身体有益,但别喝太多,否则
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.48,0:33:45.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.27,0:33:48.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好,请问
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.11,0:33:50.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,能告诉我这是哪儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.86,0:33:52.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,那家伙在问你问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:55.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我想扮演好角色
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.99,0:34:00.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫巴特,这位是巴伦·范·嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.12,0:34:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好,我是崔西
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.95,0:34:04.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙听着,我不知身处何方
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.29,0:34:08.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要么在巴黎的咖啡店,要么在新泽西的咖啡屋
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.58,0:34:10.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以肯定的是,医生告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.42,0:34:12.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个惊天的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.38,0:34:15.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都是即兴表演,放轻松,好好享受,就没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.67,0:34:18.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,我 - 谁肚子饿啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.14,0:34:24.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有秘密配方哦,特制软糖
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:27.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人在水塘里投毒
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.80,0:34:31.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,投毒,这么可恶的事谁干的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.28,0:34:40.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,坏女巫,小心,她在施展魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.24,0:34:42.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道藏哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.33,0:34:48.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,她别想找到我们
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.37,0:34:50.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.09,0:34:55.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,被发现了,我们需要太空船来逃离女巫
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.71,0:34:58.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你真在行 - 你是科班出生的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.59,0:35:00.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想知道怎么离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.34,0:35:01.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,无路可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.97,0:35:04.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,开玩笑,门就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.39,0:35:07.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是新来的吧,我叫多莉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:08.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伍迪 - 伍迪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.06,0:35:10.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不考虑换个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.69,0:35:13.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是个机会,在新的家里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.44,0:35:15.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,例如我是洋宝宝,所以我叫多莉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.19,0:35:18.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这新来的是谁 - 你真的是牛仔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.95,0:35:20.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 实际上 - 他肯定不是,小豆角
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.03,0:35:24.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他连牛仔帽都没有 - 我当然有,帽子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.37,0:35:26.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我就说 - 我找到飞船了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.83,0:35:27.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,好戏开始
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.04,0:35:30.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,快进去,绑好安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.58,0:35:34.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,收好折叠餐桌,坐稳,有点颠簸
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.79,0:35:37.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,三,二,一,发射
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.09,0:35:45.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救了我们大伙,你真是英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.73,0:35:56.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的弹簧打结了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.82,0:36:01.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的尾巴呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.24,0:36:09.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人少了一只手吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.62,0:36:12.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 鼻子呢 - 这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:13.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 给你的胳膊 - 给我,那是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.46,0:36:14.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,我的胡子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:17.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不记得游戏时间会这么累
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.59,0:36:20.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪不会这么对我们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.92,0:36:22.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.93,0:36:24.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些小孩根本就不懂怎么对待玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.76,0:36:27.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们太小了 - 他们全身都粘粘的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.18,0:36:28.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该在蝴蝶屋的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:30.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 和大一点孩子一起, - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.52,0:36:32.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我们会把事情弄清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.60,0:36:35.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去和罗梭谈谈,把我们换到蝴蝶屋去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.28,0:36:40.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死,试试那个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.74,0:36:42.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,锁上了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.28,0:36:45.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这儿也是 - 窗户呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.45,0:36:48.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,这是最先进的电子窗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.12,0:36:49.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,防止小孩乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.91,0:36:51.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们出不去了 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.04,0:36:53.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人注意到气窗了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.79,0:36:56.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们如何爬上去
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.84,0:37:02.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿等我数到三,一,二
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.05,0:37:04.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 三 - 哇
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.47,0:37:07.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.52,0:37:20.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,跳
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.49,0:37:27.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他成功了 - 好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.24,0:37:29.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,漂亮,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:35.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们以为有好日子过了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.21,0:37:36.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,隔墙有耳
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.42,0:37:40.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你先开始 - 我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.00,0:37:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爱 - 你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.34,0:37:44.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才我说的"爱"字,现在我先来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:45.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.84,0:37:47.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爱 - 你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.34,0:37:49.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白了吧,每次都会变哦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.18,0:37:50.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真有才
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.97,0:37:52.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,罗密欧,别迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.14,0:37:54.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我会想你的 - 亲亲
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.71,0:39:00.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,快下注吧,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.42,0:39:01.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有人要退出吗, - 好了,来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.67,0:39:02.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 开始
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.75,0:39:04.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 马,马 - 火鸡,火鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.92,0:39:06.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 火鸡,火鸡 - 马,马
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.55,0:39:07.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,鸭子,鸭子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.59,0:39:09.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好了,停止下注 - 停在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.59,0:39:11.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要鸭子,我要鸭子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.76,0:39:13.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,是鸭子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.43,0:39:15.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我赢了 - 喔,伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.27,0:39:18.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 章鱼赢了 - 你输了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.89,0:39:20.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,赌注,最小五片
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.77,0:39:22.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 上不封顶 - 来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.19,0:39:23.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 两张绿的 - 新一轮开始
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.77,0:39:25.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们觉得新来的玩具们怎样,能作管理员吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.98,0:39:27.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,一堆垃圾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.86,0:39:30.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 女牛仔,恐龙 - 小孩子的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.45,0:39:33.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,但那个太空人,他也许有用
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.37,0:39:37.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他不是最厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.33,0:39:39.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也不是,小胖
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.71,0:39:42.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯,你不是给自己留了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.17,0:39:44.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,别管闲事,特维奇,芭比不同
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.75,0:39:46.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,白马小王子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.75,0:39:48.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你指望女生的玩具能有啥出息
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.88,0:39:53.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是女生的玩具,我不是,你们干吗老这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.18,0:39:54.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些玩具都不用留着
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.14,0:39:57.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,能坚持一周就不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.10,0:40:05.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.94,0:40:08.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.36,0:40:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,带他去图书馆
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.90,0:40:10.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.85,0:40:43.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,西迦摩尔大街,1225号
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.48,0:40:45.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,你在干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.86,0:40:47.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我得离开
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.36,0:40:50.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要走了 - 难道你今天不开心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.03,0:40:52.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然开心,几年中最开心的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.86,0:40:55.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我属于别人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.24,0:40:58.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谁是"第岸" - 应该念"堤岸"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.37,0:41:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙计们,那是安迪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:01.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是我的邦尼
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.70,0:41:03.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,他马上要走了,我要马上回家
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.87,0:41:06.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你家在哪 - 艾尔姆街,234号
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.21,0:41:09.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们有地图吗 - 我们来搞定,崔西
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.76,0:41:12.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去开电脑
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.72,0:41:21.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,快松绑,懦夫,我要与罗梭对话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.10,0:41:22.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴,太空人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.77,0:41:25.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,没我们的允许别想和罗梭对话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.11,0:41:31.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯,怎么回事,干吗绑着他
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.73,0:41:33.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,他逃出来了,罗梭
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.74,0:41:39.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,逃出来,不,怎么能这么对待客人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.78,0:41:44.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑你,好了,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.66,0:41:46.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 罗梭,我想有些误会 - 误会
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.96,0:41:49.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,毛毛虫屋里的孩子们的年龄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.25,0:41:50.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,并不适合我和我的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.59,0:41:53.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们真诚地希望能调至蝴蝶屋
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.63,0:41:55.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.59,0:41:57.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但是,罗梭 - 好了,肯尼斯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.05,0:42:01.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个玩具很上进,是个领袖人物
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.43,0:42:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得,你适合当管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.06,0:42:06.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙听到吗,我们有了个新管理员
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:12.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,加入我们高级领导层吧,孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.61,0:42:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你想怎样就怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.53,0:42:17.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好,我去接我的朋友们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.66,0:42:20.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.32,0:42:22.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,毛毛虫屋的孩子们需要玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.79,0:42:24.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我的朋友不属于那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.79,0:42:26.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都一样,你说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.96,0:42:30.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,但为了这个大家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.46,0:42:32.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,新来的,结实的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.00,0:42:36.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,必须经受那些老一辈经受不起的磨难
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.72,0:42:40.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.64,0:42:45.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我不接受,我们是一家人,不能分开
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.14,0:42:47.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,一家人,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.69,0:42:50.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他给我绑回去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.23,0:42:53.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.23,0:42:56.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫书虫过来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.91,0:43:02.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.83,0:43:05.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,归档在光年系列下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.50,0:43:11.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.38,0:43:15.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,零件,维护,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.76,0:43:18.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,移除螺丝,打开电池仓
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.01,0:43:20.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.84,0:43:21.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.01,0:43:23.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.51,0:43:28.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,若欲将该巴斯光年太空人恢复至出厂状态
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.98,0:43:29.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.62,0:43:32.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,请将开关从"游戏"切换至"演示"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.02,0:43:36.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手,不
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.94,0:43:40.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么声音 - 从大厅传来的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.36,0:43:41.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.87,0:43:46.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,看见什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.37,0:43:49.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,黑漆漆的走廊,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.33,0:43:51.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看见安迪了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:53.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.58,0:43:56.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真的看见他了,在他的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.96,0:44:00.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白了,我另一只眼睛遗留在他房间里的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.80,0:44:06.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,感觉真奇怪,他在打包东西
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.31,0:44:11.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯特过来了,让开
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.85,0:44:14.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的,安迪在房间外的走廊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.48,0:44:17.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,在阁楼里找东西
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.90,0:44:21.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,母亲来了,他为什么那么生气
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.32,0:44:25.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,这太糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.58,0:44:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在找我们,安迪在找我们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.75,0:44:31.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,他在找我们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.33,0:44:34.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道,安迪需要我们
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.25,0:44:36.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想他确实原本想把我们放进阁楼里的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.88,0:44:38.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来伍迪说的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.75,0:44:40.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 你还怀疑他
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.76,0:44:42.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你先开始怀疑的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.38,0:44:45.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿,我们要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.76,0:44:48.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 罗梭 - 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.64,0:44:51.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个宁静的夜晚过得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.10,0:44:54.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地,看见巴斯了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.10,0:44:56.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,之前有点误会,我们要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.56,0:45:01.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,走,为什么,你们才来不久
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.15,0:45:04.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,陪小朋友玩的志愿者不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.20,0:45:06.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们喜欢新玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.12,0:45:09.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,喜欢,我们被咬,被踢,被舔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.08,0:45:12.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看我的小包包
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.29,0:45:17.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的土豆,情况是这样,你们不能离开阳光幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.79,0:45:20.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的土豆,你以为在跟谁说话
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.21,0:45:25.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有超过30个配件,你给我放尊重点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.76,0:45:28.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样更好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.47,0:45:31.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,除了我,谁都不能抢走我太太的嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.14,0:45:33.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,还给我,你这公仔熊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.27,0:45:34.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧大伙,我们回家
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.02,0:45:36.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,这位女士
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.48,0:45:38.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们哪儿也去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.40,0:45:41.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁敢挡道试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.32,0:45:44.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你来了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.15,0:45:46.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.24,0:45:48.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.33,0:45:50.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.99,0:45:52.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.37,0:45:53.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.12,0:45:59.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,囚犯已被制服,罗梭长官
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.54,0:46:01.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯,你在干吗 - 闭嘴,索戈的走狗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.84,0:46:03.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们被银河联盟拘留了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.01,0:46:05.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 索戈 - 银河联盟
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.55,0:46:06.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.68,0:46:09.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,干得好,巴斯,把他们关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.51,0:46:10.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.48,0:46:22.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.11,0:46:25.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,我们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.86,0:46:27.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,省省力气吧,妖妇
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.91,0:46:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的君主已经被打败
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.45,0:46:32.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会被你妖艳的外表所迷惑
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.66,0:46:35.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,臭鼬,把你的爪子从我老婆身上拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.37,0:46:37.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我,你这笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.21,0:46:38.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.25,0:46:41.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,这颗土豆需要学学礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.88,0:46:43.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他关进沙箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.71,0:46:46.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我,呆子,你要带我去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.55,0:46:47.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,坏宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.05,0:46:49.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.93,0:46:52.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,不是叫你在梦幻小屋等我的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.06,0:46:54.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把我的朋友们怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.72,0:46:56.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,进去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.73,0:46:59.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 芭比,等等 - 别碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.69,0:47:02.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们完了 - 芭比
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.90,0:47:05.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,围巾还我
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.86,0:47:10.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,解释一下这里过夜的规则
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.16,0:47:13.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,遵命,囚犯在牢房里就寝
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.08,0:47:17.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,若被发现不在牢房内,当晚关进沙箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.25,0:47:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,早晚各点名一次
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.46,0:47:24.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果缺席,当晚关进沙箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.59,0:47:27.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有问你话才能张嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.42,0:47:29.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果敢顶嘴,当晚
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.80,0:47:31.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,关进沙箱里,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.64,0:47:35.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,算了,大兵,她没有威胁了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.56,0:47:39.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是记住,他们很有可能使用反间计
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.10,0:47:40.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.52,0:47:43.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,在银河学院里我已经摒弃了一切杂念
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.40,0:47:45.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,小老百姓
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.98,0:47:48.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿有这儿的规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.99,0:47:51.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,从基层开始好好干的话
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.74,0:47:54.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,美梦迟早会成真的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.83,0:47:57.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,但如果你们打破规矩胡来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.70,0:48:04.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,盘算着提前出狱,那一定是自作自受
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.71,0:48:07.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,你对他做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.46,0:48:10.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,晚上好好休息
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.47,0:48:14.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天有的玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.18,0:48:23.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,西迦摩尔大街,1225
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.81,0:48:27.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,无敌星237是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.48,0:48:29.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,隔壁街的一只恐龙玩具而已
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.82,0:48:32.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么,我来应付
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:34.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就是一恐龙 - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.57,0:48:37.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,西迦摩尔,回车
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.16,0:48:40.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,千万别太远
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.75,0:48:45.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在拐角处,就在拐角处
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.13,0:48:50.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好瞧瞧,我在玩具界可是响当当哦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.55,0:48:53.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 舞会上见啦 - 好的,帅邮差
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.51,0:48:56.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,等下,如果你们去阳光幼儿园的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.01,0:48:58.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉他们伍迪已经回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.18,0:49:01.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你从阳光幼儿园来的 - 你是怎么逃出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.48,0:49:03.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.31,0:49:05.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说"逃"什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.15,0:49:10.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,阳光幼儿园充满了毁灭与绝望
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.32,0:49:13.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,由一只草莓味道的邪恶熊掌管着
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.03,0:49:16.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.28,0:49:18.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,它外表看上去和蔼可亲
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.03,0:49:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,内心却是一只禽兽
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.04,0:49:23.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.87,0:49:26.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,由小丑来告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.21,0:49:33.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认识罗梭
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.38,0:49:38.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,他曾是个好玩具,好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.93,0:49:42.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的主人是黛西
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.14,0:49:47.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看着主人打开罗梭的包装
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:51.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,黛西很爱我们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.73,0:49:52.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.36,0:49:55.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,特别爱罗梭
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.61,0:49:58.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们形影不离
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.82,0:50:02.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我从没见过一个孩子如此喜爱他的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.79,0:50:05.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,一日我们出去旅游
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.87,0:50:10.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,在休息站,我们小玩了一会
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:13.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,午餐后,黛西睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.35,0:50:23.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,她再也没有回来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.36,0:50:31.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭不愿意放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:38.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然旅途艰辛,但我们还是回到黛西家
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.20,0:50:47.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,但一切的一切的都晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.51,0:51:02.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,那天,罗梭内心有什么东西变了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.01,0:51:04.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,突然之间
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.68,0:51:07.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,她买了新玩具替代了我们,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.23,0:51:10.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,只是你被替代了 - 我们都被替代了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.81,0:51:11.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.98,0:51:17.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,她不再爱你了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.70,0:51:19.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.99,0:51:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们被遗忘,被抛弃,没人爱,没人要
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.59,0:51:36.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,随后我们到了阳光幼儿园
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.39,0:51:49.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,但罗梭已不再是一个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.44,0:51:53.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁的朋友也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.19,0:51:59.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,他掌管了阳光幼儿园,制定了严格的体制
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.90,0:52:01.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你怎么逃出来
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:05.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我坏掉了,邦尼发现了我并带回家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:08.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,其它的玩具,就没那么幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.20,0:52:12.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭是邪恶的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.38,0:52:15.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,新玩具毫无选择的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.59,0:52:17.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但我的朋友在里面 - 你不能回去
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.96,0:52:20.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,回去就是自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.42,0:52:22.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有你的安迪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.30,0:52:25.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不是要离家去大学吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.86,0:52:46.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,别吵,音乐小猪,放下口琴
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.24,0:52:52.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,红心,我也想伍迪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.50,0:52:56.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他不会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.22,0:53:03.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,(安迪)
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.52,0:53:20.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.07,0:53:22.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭长官
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.57,0:53:25.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切正常,别无异样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.11,0:53:28.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好,巴斯,上车,我们要回星际指挥部
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.74,0:53:31.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,你们把我老公怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.70,0:53:32.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,大宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.46,0:53:39.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.13,0:53:45.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,那里又黑又冷,只有沙子和一些积木
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.01,0:53:47.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得那些不是积木
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.72,0:53:51.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,好好准备一下,好好履行你们的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.85,0:55:14.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.93,0:55:16.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不该回来的,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.73,0:55:21.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你离开后,他们受了欺压而且还派更多看守提高巡逻密度
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.19,0:55:23.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和你的朋友别想离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.40,0:55:24.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我逃走过一次
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.73,0:55:27.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是你幸运,想听我的建议不
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.69,0:55:30.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,低调点,就能活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.20,0:55:31.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,低调多久啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.91,0:55:33.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这儿好几年了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.58,0:55:35.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,从没坏过
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.62,0:55:38.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,想离开这儿只有一条路
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.41,0:55:42.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,可怜的伙计,垃圾车破晓时过来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.50,0:55:44.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,开去垃圾场
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.84,0:55:47.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的关心,老前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.26,0:55:50.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的主人还在等我们呢,我们马上要走
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.43,0:55:53.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你能帮助我们大家,我会非常感激
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.56,0:55:57.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你想离开
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.02,0:55:59.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先要搞定的是那些门
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.44,0:56:04.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,每晚必锁,从里到外,钥匙挂在办公室的墙上
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.77,0:56:05.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白,还有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.90,0:56:08.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭的卡车队伍通宵巡逻
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.61,0:56:10.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,走廊,大厅,操场都有人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.61,0:56:11.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道了,怎么穿过围墙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.78,0:56:15.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,8英尺的高墙,无法穿过
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.20,0:56:16.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,要么翻过去,要么挖地洞
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.83,0:56:18.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,仅此而已,不算太坏
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.79,0:56:21.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,错,你真正的问题是猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.75,0:56:25.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,猴子眼观六路
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.46,0:56:27.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,监控着一切
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.88,0:56:29.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,课室
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.14,0:56:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,走廊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:52.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至游乐场
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.00,0:57:03.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算有人能撬开门锁,躲过守卫,飞檐走壁
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.33,0:57:07.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是如果你不先解决掉猴子,你哪都走不了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.04,0:57:11.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,想逃出这里是吗,除掉猴子再说
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.47,0:57:14.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子们,过来,课间休息
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.81,0:57:21.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.89,0:57:24.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是伍迪吗 - 伍迪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.85,0:57:25.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.35,0:57:28.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伙计 - 谢天谢地
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.82,0:57:31.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还活着 - 我当然还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.32,0:57:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的帽子,等等,巴斯呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:36.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭对他动了点手脚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.95,0:57:39.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,他现在又认为自己是个太空游侠了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.20,0:57:40.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.99,0:57:42.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,宇宙白痴回归
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.91,0:57:47.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,我们当初不应该离开安迪的,我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.75,0:57:50.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,洁西说得没错,她是错了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.21,0:57:53.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不不,我选择离开你们才是真正的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.55,0:57:55.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,从现在开始,我们永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.88,0:57:57.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是安迪马上就要去上大学了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.72,0:57:59.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,大学,我们得赶快行动
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.68,0:58:02.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要在明天安迪出发之前把你送回家
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.39,0:58:03.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天,那意味着
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.02,0:58:06.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得马上逃出去,就今天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.10,0:58:08.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么,不可能的 - 这里根本没有办法可以逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.40,0:58:11.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,有路可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.94,0:58:13.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一条路
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.49,0:58:17.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们下面这么办
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.08,0:58:25.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 弹簧狗 - 在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.58,0:58:27.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,绿娃娃
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.25,0:58:29.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 女牛仔, - 在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.79,0:58:30.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,马
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.09,0:58:33.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小猪存钱罐 - 在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.17,0:58:35.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 霸王龙 - 在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.51,0:58:38.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 芭比 - 在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.59,0:58:40.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,蛋头
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.14,0:58:42.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,蛋头
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.72,0:58:46.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,蛋头,给我起来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.48,0:58:48.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.48,0:58:51.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.04,0:59:06.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在散步也太晚了点吧,蛋头
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.00,0:59:09.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫我蛋头先生,你这个小人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.92,0:59:13.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是爱惹麻烦是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.46,0:59:16.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想怎么地,想跑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.13,0:59:17.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,要不是你的手下捣乱
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.47,0:59:19.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实我本都能跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.13,0:59:20.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这好管闲事的娘娘腔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.89,0:59:22.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你根本不是玩具,你只不过是附属物罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.05,0:59:25.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,毫无用处的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.31,0:59:26.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他关进沙箱里去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.98,0:59:29.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我不要去沙箱里,抱歉,我不是那个意思,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.84,0:59:31.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我其实挺喜欢娘娘腔来着
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.40,0:59:33.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.19,0:59:35.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.48,0:59:39.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,干得不错,好了,继续当你那什么宇宙英雄去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.49,0:59:41.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,遵命,仪表堂堂的长官
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.95,0:59:44.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯,肯
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.20,0:59:48.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.62,0:59:52.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯,我受不了了,我想去蝴蝶屋,和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.13,0:59:53.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你昨天就应该意识到的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.17,0:59:55.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.50,0:59:58.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真的想和你一起待在你那梦幻小屋里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.72,1:00:02.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,带我离开这儿好吗,带我走
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.55,1:00:04.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.10,1:00:07.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,但这里事情很复杂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.68,1:00:10.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你必须要照我说的做 - 我会听你的,我保证
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.85,1:00:15.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,我愿意做任何事情,帮你换尿布也行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.65,1:01:04.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,去,拿,胶,带
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.08,1:01:13.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里就是奇迹发生的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.96,1:01:16.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看这些衣服
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.38,1:01:18.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信你之前居然没带我来过
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.59,1:01:20.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 白色网球套装,火星计划 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.84,1:01:22.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个,功夫服
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.63,1:01:25.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,帆布英雄和与之配套的优胜锦旗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.89,1:01:28.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,印花衫,天啊,肯
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.93,1:01:33.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,这里没人懂得欣赏服装,没有一人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.10,1:01:38.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯,你能穿上几套炫给我看看吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.94,1:01:40.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,几套就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.06,1:02:12.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,去拿钥匙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.64,1:02:14.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,在哪儿在哪儿,钥匙在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.85,1:02:16.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,钥匙到底在哪儿,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.49,1:02:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为你在干吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.45,1:02:32.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我早就和你说过,不许碰我的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.74,1:02:34.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,动手啊,你这肥猪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.29,1:02:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,不许打架,都给我住手
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.00,1:02:42.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 接住,榆木脑袋
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.30,1:02:43.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,难怪你都要绝种了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.26,1:02:46.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不能打人,只有我可以
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.64,1:02:52.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,请求支援,监狱暴动
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.27,1:02:56.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,去拿玉米薄饼
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.27,1:03:38.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗 - 好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.73,1:03:47.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.03,1:03:52.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,游戏结束,肯,罗梭到底对巴斯干了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.78,1:03:54.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么能将他回复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.12,1:03:56.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么也不会说的,你拿我没办法
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.75,1:03:59.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,不信你试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.13,1:04:53.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我看看,夏威夷冲浪短裤
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.89,1:04:56.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,那可是古董衣
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.80,1:04:58.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系,你撕吧,我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.77,1:05:00.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们一点都不值钱
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.31,1:05:01.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,闪光礼服
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.27,1:05:06.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁在乎,没人在乎,那些衣服太低俗了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.32,1:05:08.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,尼赫鲁上装
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.23,1:05:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,不要撕尼赫鲁装啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.49,1:05:13.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么年代来着,1967年吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.32,1:05:14.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,最时髦的正装收藏
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.20,1:05:18.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真可惜啊 - 不要,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.99,1:05:20.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,有本使用说明书
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.75,1:05:24.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭把巴斯调到演示模式了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.46,1:05:27.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,说明书在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.50,1:05:31.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真不懂为什么你不能等到早上,肯
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.88,1:05:33.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.90,1:05:48.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼,怎么这么久
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.40,1:05:53.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能修好巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.88,1:06:13.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,小鸟,你盯着我看干吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.55,1:06:16.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.22,1:06:23.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,快飞走吧,胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.89,1:06:28.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,真是棒极了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.19,1:06:36.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,请求支援,监狱暴动
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.82,1:06:38.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 请求帮助 - 别喊了,没人听得见
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.24,1:06:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 我说没人听得见你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.99,1:06:45.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 他说,没人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.33,1:06:46.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.50,1:06:48.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,你回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.50,1:06:53.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住他,别让他跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.88,1:06:56.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,星球总部,我被我所看守的犯人留作人质
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.93,1:07:00.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,打开后盖,那儿有个开关
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.80,1:07:02.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,放开我,你们这些索戈人渣
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.64,1:07:05.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,银河法院不会对你们仁慈的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.43,1:07:08.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,为什么不行,说明书在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.77,1:07:11.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这儿,开关的下面应该有个小洞
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.44,1:07:14.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小洞,找到了 - 如果要把巴斯光年恢复出厂设置
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.15,1:07:16.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 插入回形针 - 雷克斯,用你的手指
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.32,1:07:17.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.11,1:07:19.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好了,现在怎么办 - 让我看看
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.82,1:07:22.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,注意别超过五秒
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.12,1:07:27.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不能怪我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.50,1:07:34.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 星球日志
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.00,1:07:37.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 我在一个奇怪的行星上从深睡眠醒来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.17,1:07:39.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你到底干了什么 - 我只是照你说的做了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.65,1:07:42.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 我被未知生物包围
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.05,1:07:45.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 谁在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.10,1:07:46.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 是敌是友
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.48,1:07:49.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友,都是朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.00,1:07:53.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 我的飞船一定坠毁了,我的记忆也被消除了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.87,1:07:56.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 有人见到我的飞船了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.82,1:07:58.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得把他调回来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.15,1:08:01.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么调 - 不知道,这部分是西班牙语
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.16,1:08:04.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没时间了,走吧,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.03,1:08:06.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 你知道我飞船在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.03,1:08:07.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.33,1:08:09.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,牛仔,祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.75,1:08:17.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.51,1:08:21.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,快过来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.80,1:08:24.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么那么久
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.35,1:08:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 情况变复杂了 - 蛋头在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.68,1:08:28.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们没见到他
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.52,1:08:31.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.70,1:08:35.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 我的沙漠之花
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.90,1:08:39.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 我终于见到我的梦中情人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.86,1:08:42.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们把巴斯修好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.03,1:08:44.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 差不多吧 - 你后面
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.82,1:08:46.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人在靠近
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.70,1:08:52.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不会相信我今晚都经历了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.71,1:08:54.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.54,1:08:57.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉很健康,焕然一新,其实糟糕极了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.13,1:09:00.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你减肥了,还长高了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.09,1:09:04.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还是喜欢这个样子多点
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.93,1:09:10.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切正常
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.60,1:09:16.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来,快点过来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.27,1:09:19.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们胜利在望了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.07,1:09:25.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,回去,快回去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.08,1:09:33.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.93,1:10:42.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 过来这边
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.33,1:10:45.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 小姐,跟我来,我会带你去欣赏银河奇观
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.53,1:10:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 而我们将在一起战胜恶魔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.58,1:10:52.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.83,1:10:56.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,我们马上就到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.50,1:10:58.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 可恶的牛仔
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.42,1:11:07.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,过来帮我上去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.40,1:11:12.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 巴斯光年,拯救世界
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.76,1:11:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 任务完成
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.69,1:11:21.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,帅呆了,巴斯,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.82,1:11:28.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这安全吗 - 我去探探路
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.37,1:11:37.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伍迪,你还好吧 - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.87,1:11:40.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,下来吧,但不要一起下来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.37,1:11:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他说什么 - 我想他是叫我们一起下去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.34,1:11:43.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不不
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.71,1:11:45.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 啊呀 - 小心
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.88,1:11:49.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,洁西,谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.42,1:11:51.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 我的飞船在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.72,1:11:52.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,胜利就在眼前
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.47,1:11:55.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗,你能跳过去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.47,1:11:58.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也许已经老了,但我仍然步伐矫健
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.15,1:12:03.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他成功了 - 弹簧狗,好样的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.11,1:12:04.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,爬过来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.90,1:12:09.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,小狗狗,迷路了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.24,1:12:15.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看谁回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.79,1:12:25.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,牛仔,我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.92,1:12:28.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们废了我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.30,1:12:31.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们想干吗,跑回你们主人那儿吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.72,1:12:33.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他根本不要你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.84,1:12:35.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 骗人 - 是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.60,1:12:37.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我,警长
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.35,1:12:40.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你的主人这么爱你,为什么他要走呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.94,1:12:42.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,牛仔,你别以为自己很特别
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.19,1:12:47.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不过是块塑料罢了,你注定是要被丢弃的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.94,1:12:50.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,说曹操,曹操到
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.53,1:12:59.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要有玩具在毛毛虫屋
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.83,1:13:02.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们也不想被垃圾车装走
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.58,1:13:06.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,浪子回头,重新加入我们的大家庭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.54,1:13:10.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这才不是什么大家庭,这里是监狱,你是个骗子和恶棍
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.51,1:13:14.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我宁愿烂在这垃圾箱里也不要加入你的大家庭
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.55,1:13:18.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,洁西说得没错,权力是由人民的同意授予
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.35,1:13:19.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,而不是武力威胁得到
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.02,1:13:22.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就别怪我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.85,1:13:27.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,等等,罗梭,别这样
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.98,1:13:32.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,她不过是个芭比娃娃,世界上一抓一大把
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.07,1:13:34.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我来说她却是唯一的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.95,1:13:38.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啊,那你也去他们那边吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.54,1:13:42.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,肯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.00,1:13:44.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.25,1:13:47.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们公平友好相处,阳光幼儿园会是个温馨的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.13,1:13:50.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,是罗梭建立的金字塔制度
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.96,1:13:52.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,把自己放在顶端
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.72,1:13:54.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人赞成肯说的话吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.89,1:14:00.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可没把你们丢弃,是你们的主人把你们丢弃的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.68,1:14:03.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,有孩子真正爱过一个玩具吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.35,1:14:05.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,在垃圾场里好好想想吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.35,1:14:07.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,那黛西呢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.61,1:14:11.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.40,1:14:14.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,黛西,你曾经和她形影不离
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.11,1:14:16.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错,但她把我们丢弃了 - 不
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.61,1:14:18.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她只是丢失了你们 - 她找新玩具替代了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.03,1:14:20.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,她替代了你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.95,1:14:22.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你不能拥有她,那就没人可以
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.04,1:14:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你骗了大宝宝,而且你一直在撒谎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.87,1:14:29.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你哪儿弄来的, - 她曾经深爱着你,罗梭
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.34,1:14:30.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,她从来没有爱过我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.59,1:14:32.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个孩子能有多爱玩具,她就有多爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.80,1:14:37.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.18,1:14:40.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了,想妈妈了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.76,1:14:44.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,她从来没有爱过你,别这么孩子气了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.98,1:14:48.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他们都推下去,全部都推下去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.40,1:14:52.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是你们胡思乱想的后果
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.48,1:14:57.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们全是垃圾,等着被丢弃,玩具的命运就是如此
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.86,1:15:01.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,快停下,你个白痴,把我放下来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.91,1:15:06.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,等等,大宝宝,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.46,1:15:11.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他完蛋了 - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.80,1:15:18.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点过来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.02,1:15:26.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.06,1:15:26.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 牛仔,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.60,1:15:31.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.15,1:15:37.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊,车来了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.28,1:15:41.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,跳
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.83,1:15:43.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比,别去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.46,1:15:49.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.50,1:15:54.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.09,1:16:01.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,能听到我说话吗,大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.30,1:16:04.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你个笨蛋,当然有事,我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.14,1:16:07.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都去巴斯那里,速度
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.10,1:16:12.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人都在吧,弹簧狗,雷克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.40,1:16:18.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,全部人靠边站,速度
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.80,1:16:20.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,[外语] 小姐,你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.87,1:16:21.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.17,1:16:33.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们过不来了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.05,1:16:44.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.85,1:16:49.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.94,1:16:59.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看到他了吗 - 我找到他了,在这儿呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.41,1:17:04.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.70,1:17:08.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.63,1:17:19.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是我身上的味道吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.80,1:17:23.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,你回来了回来了回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.88,1:17:26.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,我回来了,我之前去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.85,1:17:28.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙,太空游侠
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.06,1:17:32.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,我们现在在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.31,1:17:34.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,在去垃圾场的垃圾车上
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.88,1:17:38.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,(垃圾场)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.87,1:17:49.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧,我们要下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.38,1:18:06.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你零部件都在吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.93,1:18:08.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,利爪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.30,1:18:12.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的孩子们 - 伙计们,别过去
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.56,1:18:14.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.28,1:18:22.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,坚持住
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.62,1:18:37.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,我们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.12,1:18:38.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们只要在一起就不会有事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.13,1:18:41.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伍迪 - 弹簧狗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.30,1:18:45.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,是磁铁,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.80,1:18:48.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,弹簧狗,别担心,我们会把你弄下来的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.26,1:18:49.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,你先看看这个再说
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.97,1:18:55.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,快,抓点金属的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.81,1:19:02.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,快按巴斯说的做
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.11,1:19:07.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,没用
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.53,1:19:14.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命,救我啊,我被卡住了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.08,1:19:17.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.33,1:19:19.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.00,1:19:23.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢了 - 先别谢我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.59,1:19:27.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.39,1:19:38.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.52,1:19:45.90,chs,,0,0,0,,警长,谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.98,1:19:47.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是一根绳上的蚂蚱
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.49,1:19:48.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家说呢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.07,1:19:51.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.37,1:19:53.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,我们在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.20,1:19:58.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伍迪 - 伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.29,1:20:02.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,我能看见阳光了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.63,1:20:04.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.25,1:20:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.05,1:20:08.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不认为那是阳光
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.89,1:20:16.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.72,1:20:28.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,(停止按钮)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.78,1:20:36.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,警长,那个按钮,帮我一把
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.12,1:20:37.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.33,1:20:41.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去按按钮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.96,1:20:50.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.34,1:20:55.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 按啊,快按按钮 - 按啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.97,1:20:59.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,警长,你的主人现在在哪儿呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.89,1:21:01.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.23,1:21:02.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗梭
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.56,1:21:05.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.91,1:21:23.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,雷克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.92,1:21:32.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,我们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.50,1:22:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,利爪
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.20,1:23:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我之前说过的所有对阁楼的怨言
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.16,1:23:26.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我全部收回
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.75,1:23:28.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你说得一点没错 - 你说出了我们的心声
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.88,1:23:37.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,你真勇敢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.22,1:23:42.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你救了我们 - 我们永远感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.93,1:23:45.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的孩子们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.31,1:23:46.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.98,1:23:49.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,那只毛茸茸的罗梭呢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.14,1:23:51.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真想把他碎尸万段
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.44,1:23:54.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,算了吧,别跟他一般见识
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.41,1:24:04.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 找到了什么好东东
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.95,1:24:07.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我小时候玩过这个玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.41,1:24:09.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,草莓味的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.92,1:24:17.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟,你最好把嘴巴闭起来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.26,1:24:25.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,伍迪,我们要把你送回家
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.81,1:24:28.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 没错,大学生 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.10,1:24:30.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你们怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.65,1:24:33.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许阁楼并不是什么好主意
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.44,1:24:39.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伍迪,我们是安迪的玩具 - 我们会一起在那儿等他的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.82,1:24:43.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但愿他还没走 - 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.20,1:24:44.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,我帮你看看
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.99,1:24:48.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪还在收拾,不过已经快弄好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.04,1:24:52.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 但他住在城市的另一边 - 我们永远也赶不上的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.60,1:25:11.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 过来,巴斯特 - 亲爱的,都收拾好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.14,1:25:12.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,就差我房间里面的几个盒子
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.89,1:25:13.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.48,1:25:18.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.78,1:25:20.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.12,1:25:30.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,安全
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.21,1:25:40.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这儿呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.89,1:25:48.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 进去了 - 巴斯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.06,1:25:56.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这不是永别 - 伍迪,在大学玩得开心点
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.44,1:25:58.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,但别疯过头了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.31,1:26:02.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 伍迪,照顾好安迪, - 对呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.32,1:26:04.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,他是个好孩子,叫他去理个发
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.78,1:26:06.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.07,1:26:10.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,洁西,你在阁楼没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.29,1:26:14.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,那当然,再说了,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.46,1:26:17.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 巴斯的西班牙模式了 - 我的什么
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.13,1:26:18.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,路上带点吃的不
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.79,1:26:19.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我饿了路上买吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.84,1:26:23.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道在哪里可以找到我们,牛仔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.40,1:26:39.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和莫莉说再见了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.86,1:26:42.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈,我和她都道别十次了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.20,1:26:47.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,安迪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.54,1:26:56.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.33,1:27:00.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,我只是,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.30,1:27:05.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,真希望永远陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.01,1:27:09.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会的,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.24,1:27:27.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不和巴斯特说声再见吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.24,1:27:29.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我当然会啦,谁是我的好狗狗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.53,1:27:32.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁是我的好狗狗,我会想你,我会想你的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.62,1:27:40.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我会想你的 - 别了,安迪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.75,1:27:46.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,乖,他提醒你该出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.46,1:27:47.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,把剩下的东西都收好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.01,1:27:51.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见了,巴斯特,别让莫莉动我的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.73,1:27:58.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.78,1:28:09.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈,你真的认为我应该把这些捐了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.11,1:28:13.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,随你吧,亲爱的,你说了算
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.89,1:28:43.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,别进去那里,糕饼店有鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.81,1:28:47.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗,你会把鬼都吵醒的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.19,1:28:49.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心,鬼魂在向你扔派
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.11,1:28:53.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.12,1:28:55.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安迪 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.58,1:28:57.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.45,1:28:59.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说你要去上大学了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.41,1:29:01.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,就要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.41,1:29:03.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能帮到你什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.42,1:29:05.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我这儿有些玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.34,1:29:07.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,听到了吗,邦尼
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.67,1:29:10.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是邦尼吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.63,1:29:12.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是安迪
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.64,1:29:16.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人告诉我你对玩具很好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.39,1:29:20.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些是我的玩具,但是我现在要离开了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.64,1:29:25.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我希望能找一个很特别的人和他们一起玩
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.07,1:29:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是洁西,整个西部最牛最厉害的牛仔女郎
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.78,1:29:39.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,她很喜欢《魔晶》,不过她更喜欢她最好的搭档,红心
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.00,1:29:44.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.35,1:30:02.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是雷克斯,有史以来最坏最可怕的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.98,1:30:12.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是蛋头先生和蛋头太太,你一定要把他们放在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.32,1:30:14.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为他们无比相爱
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.78,1:30:18.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是弹簧狗,忠诚不二的狗狗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.49,1:30:21.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有火腿,保你钱财无失
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.79,1:30:26.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他同时也是世界上最怯懦的坏蛋,邪恶博士猪排
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.92,1:30:32.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些小东西来自一个奇怪的世界
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.26,1:30:34.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,披萨星球
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.26,1:30:37.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有这个
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.97,1:30:43.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是巴斯光年,史上最酷的玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.68,1:30:46.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看,他可以飞,还能发射激光
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.02,1:30:50.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,他发誓要保护宇宙免受邪恶索戈的控制
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.11,1:30:54.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,飞向宇宙,浩瀚无限
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.86,1:30:58.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得向我保证你会好好照顾这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.87,1:31:04.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们对我来说无比重要
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.38,1:31:11.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的牛仔
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.42,1:31:17.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,伍迪,他在这里干吗
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.89,1:31:21.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有只蛇在我的靴子里 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.56,1:31:25.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,有只蛇在我的靴子里
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.86,1:31:44.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,从我记事开始,伍迪就是我的好伙伴了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.37,1:31:47.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很勇敢,就像真正的牛仔那样
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.58,1:31:49.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,善良又聪明
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.58,1:31:56.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,但伍迪最特别的地方,就是他永远不会对你失去信心
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.26,1:31:58.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,从不
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.26,1:32:01.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管发生了什么事情,他都会在你身边
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.81,1:32:08.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为你可以帮我照顾好他吗
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.60,1:32:10.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.99,1:32:25.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,不好了,猪排博士在攻击闹鬼的糕饼店
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.62,1:32:28.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,鬼魂都在逃逸,伍迪会来阻止他们的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.41,1:32:29.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯光年来拯救世界
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.08,1:32:32.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会需要这个火箭的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.25,1:32:35.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们要跑了,快
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.34,1:32:41.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们赶紧上飞船,火山要爆发了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.97,1:32:44.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,看呀,有条狗在袭击他们
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.85,1:32:46.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,尝尝这个毒饼
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.31,1:32:48.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,蛋头夫妇有麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.56,1:32:50.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,上车,伍迪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.94,1:32:53.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我的朋友伍迪
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.44,1:32:57.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,快,打开备用的涡轮增压
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.72,1:33:26.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们,伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.27,1:33:32.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈看,他们都在一起玩呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.85,1:33:34.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,过来吧,我们要吃午饭了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.53,1:33:50.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见了,伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.21,1:33:58.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,我来跟你介绍,这些是邦尼的玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.67,1:34:01.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会喜欢他们的,这位是多莉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.79,1:34:33.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,新玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.68,1:34:46.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,碰碰鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.96,1:36:10.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在阳光幼儿园终于重现阳光
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.34,1:36:13.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望很快再能收到你的消息,我们超级期待你的新家
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.93,1:36:16.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱你们大家哦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.43,1:36:20.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,芭比字写得很好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.35,1:36:24.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,巴斯,这不是芭比写的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.69,1:36:27.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拿着剑 - 拿好了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.94,1:36:29.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好,去赢得, - 三倍奖金
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.20,1:36:30.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 我们得到黑暗披风啦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.36,1:36:33.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 跑,快跑 - 我的手臂从不够长
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.20,1:36:35.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来,好了,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.20,1:36:37.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 帅 - 我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.87,1:36:39.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,击掌,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.33,1:36:45.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们正式上榜了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.38,1:36:48.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 看 - 神奇鲍勃,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.55,1:36:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都在这了,看起来不错啊
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.93,1:36:54.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,她真的能让你开心
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.60,1:37:03.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.90,1:37:07.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉过你们了,孩子们,离我屁股远点
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.78,1:37:12.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,但那边窗缝里透出的是什么光
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.57,1:37:15.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗密欧啊,罗密欧,为什么罗密欧偏偏是你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.49,1:37:18.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,下一季,我们演《猫》
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.62,1:37:21.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是演《哈姆雷特》呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.33,1:37:25.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管是只剩一只翅膀还是化妆掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.58,1:37:27.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,大力胶都可以修复
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.68,1:37:40.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道自己是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.10,1:37:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟着感觉走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:59.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,
